
# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:51
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9f3f1963:

    # "Al llegar a Los Angeles, hay una limusina enviada por la amiga de [lis] esperándoos."
    "Upon arriving in Los Angeles, there is a limousine sent by [lis]'s friend, waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:52
translate english c29s001_LisParty_cc83c1af:

    # "Casi podrías acostumbrarte a este tipo de servicio, aunque lo consideras excesivo."
    "You could almost get used to this kind of service, even though you consider it excessive."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:53
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d19f7c51:

    # "Nunca habías subido a un helicóptero y llevas varios viajes en la última semana. Y lo de las limusinas... Con un Under habría habido suficiente."
    "You have never been on a helicopter, and you've taken several trips in the last week. And the limousines?... An Under would have been enough."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:54
translate english c29s001_LisParty_738582fb:

    # "Empiezas a pensar que el ecologista eres tú en vez de [lis]."
    "You're starting to think that you're the environmentalist instead of [lis]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:56
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9ea7bcf5:

    # "Una vez dentro del coche..."
    "Once inside the car..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:57
translate english c29s001_LisParty_296655d9:

    # mc "Sabía que faltaba algo. Me extrañaba que no llevaras pendientes."
    mc "I knew something was missing. I was surprised you weren't wearing earrings."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:58
translate english c29s001_LisParty_82bdde9d:

    # lis "Nunca te pongas unos pendientes grandes si vas a usar los auriculares de un helicóptero. Es fácil que se enreden."
    lis "Never wear large earrings if you're going to use helicopter headphones. They can easily get tangled."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:59
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e3a2bd18:

    # mc "*Risa* No me pondré pendientes en ese caso. O en ninguno."
    mc "*Laugh* I won't wear earrings in that case. Or in any case."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:61
translate english c29s001_LisParty_47c6133a:

    # lis "*Risa* Los chicos lo tenéis mucho más fácil. Casi no os despeináis. A veces os envidio."
    lis "*Laugh* Guys have it so much easier. You hardly mess up your hair. Sometimes I envy you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:62
translate english c29s001_LisParty_36c3903c:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso sería como si yo envidiara a los hombres calvos porque ellos no pueden despeinarse."
    mc "*Laugh* That would be like me envying bald men because they can't mess up their hair."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:63
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5e1b25da:

    # mc "A veces echo de menos el pelo largo que llevaba cuando volví de Portland. Después me doy cuenta de lo cómodo que es esto y se me pasa."
    mc "Sometimes I miss the long hair I had when I came back from Portland. Then I realize how comfortable this is, and the feeling passes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:65
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5705ee66:

    # lis "¿Llevabas el pelo largo? No puedo imaginarte con el pelo largo."
    lis "You had long hair? I can't imagine you with long hair."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:66
translate english c29s001_LisParty_bea6c798:

    # mc "¿No te ha enseñado [sai] ninguna foto de cuando estábamos en Portland?"
    mc "Hasn't [sai] shown you any pictures from when we were in Portland?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:68
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d7b25d3f:

    # lis "Sí, pero deben ser más antiguas, porque llevabas el pelo como ahora y ella lo llevaba un poco más largo que yo."
    lis "Yes, but they must have been older pictures, because your hair was like it is now, and hers was a little longer than mine."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:69
translate english c29s001_LisParty_cfb42710:

    # mc "Sí, esas son del principio de 'salir juntos'. Los últimos meses fueron una locura y no visité una peluquería... creo que desde antes de Navidad."
    mc "Yeah, those are from the beginning of our 'dating'. The last few months were crazy, and I didn't visit a barber... I think since before Christmas."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:70
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ea9c3021:

    # mc "Cuando volví a casa fue una de las primeras cosas que hice. [nor] se reía de mí diciendo que parecía un bárbaro."
    mc "When I got back home, that was one of the first things I did. [nor] laughed at me, saying I looked like a barbarian."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:71
translate english c29s001_LisParty_de51c229:

    # mc "Lo llevaba un poco más corto de lo que lo llevas tú, pero no mucho más corto."
    mc "It was a little shorter than yours, but not by much."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:73
translate english c29s001_LisParty_02405c28:

    # lis "Les preguntaré a las chicas si tienen fotos tuyas con el pelo largo. Conociéndote, estoy casi segura de que no te haces selfies."
    lis "I'll ask the girls if they have pictures of you with long hair. Knowing you, I'm almost certain you don't take selfies."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:74
translate english c29s001_LisParty_db7befd3:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Quieres apostar?"
    mc "*Laugh* Want to bet?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:76
translate english c29s001_LisParty_438a75aa:

    # lis "¿Qué? ¿Te haces selfies? Eres una de las pocas personas de las que nunca lo habría dicho..."
    lis "What? You take selfies? You're one of the few people I would never have said that about..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:77
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c3b58748:

    # mc "*Risa* No."
    mc "*Laugh* No."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:79
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9e2c523d:

    # lis "*Risa* Idiota."
    lis "*Laugh* Idiot."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:80
translate english c29s001_LisParty_bd8341fe:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo también te quiero."
    mc "*Laugh* I love you too."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:83
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7554661d:

    # "Al cabo de unos minutos llegáis al piso de la amiga de [lis]. El ascensor os deja en un pasillo que lleva al salón."
    "After a few minutes, you arrive at [lis]'s friend's apartment. The elevator leaves you in a hallway that leads to the living room."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:94
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3b835d5f:

    # lis "Vamos a buscar a Sidney. Quiero que la conozcas, aunque seguro que la has visto en alguna de sus series o películas. Lo petó en 'Eufórica'"
    lis "Let's go find Sidney. I want you to meet her, although I'm sure you've seen her in one of her series or movies. She killed it in 'Euphoric'."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:95
translate english c29s001_LisParty_b5d1d7a0:

    # mc "Espera. ¿Es esa Sidney? ¿Sidney Todd?"
    mc "Wait. Is that Sidney? Sidney Todd?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:97
translate english c29s001_LisParty_8d22985b:

    # lis "Sí. ¿No te lo había dicho? ¿Te gusta esa serie?"
    lis "Yes. Didn't I tell you? Do you like that show?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:98
translate english c29s001_LisParty_76fefa72:

    # mc "No tuve tiempo de seguirla demasiado. Creo que vi uno o dos episodios donde todos los personajes me caían mal."
    mc "I didn't have time to follow it much. I think I saw one or two episodes where I disliked all the characters."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:100
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5b4296ac:

    # lis "*Risa* No se lo digas a Sidney. La han nominado a un Globo de Plata por ese papel."
    lis "*Laugh* Don't tell Sidney that. She was nominated for a Silvery Globe for that role."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:101
translate english c29s001_LisParty_99653dce:

    # lis "Vamos a buscarla."
    lis "Let's go find her."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:103
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d83a4d1b:

    # lis "¡SIDNEY!"
    lis "SIDNEY!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:104
translate english c29s001_LisParty_205d30af:

    # sid "¡[lis!u]! ¡Has llegado!"
    sid "[lis!u]! You made it!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:106
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3f9873bd:

    # lis "Gracias por mandarnos el coche, Sid."
    lis "Thanks for sending the car for us, Sid."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:107
translate english c29s001_LisParty_48187e0c:

    # sid "*Risa* Deja de crecer o al final vas a tener que pedirle ropa prestada a [deb]."
    sid "*Laugh* Stop growing or you'll end up having to borrow clothes from [deb]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:108
translate english c29s001_LisParty_aa66c29e:

    # lis "Ven. Quiero presentarte a alguien."
    lis "Come here. I want to introduce you to someone."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:110
translate english c29s001_LisParty_eb3c4ab8:

    # lis "Sid, éste es [mc]. Mi novio."
    lis "Sid, this is [mc]. My boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:111
translate english c29s001_LisParty_33764a5d:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte, Sidney."
    mc "Nice to meet you, Sidney."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:112
translate english c29s001_LisParty_64d34bc4:

    # sid "Igualmente, [mc]. ¿Así que por fin alguien le ha echado el lazo a nuestra [lis]?"
    sid "Likewise, [mc]. So, someone finally managed to snag our [lis]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:113
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0df8848c:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso parece."
    mc "*Laugh* It seems so."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:115
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0b13a6f5:

    # lis "*Risa* O a lo mejor he sido yo quién le ha echado el lazo a él."
    lis "*Laugh* Or maybe I'm the one who snagged him."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:116
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a0dd3b9a:

    # sid "*Risa* Entonces se puede considerar que está entre los hombres más afortunados del mundo, si te has interesado por él."
    sid "*Laugh* Then he can be considered one of the luckiest men in the world, if you're interested in him."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:117
translate english c29s001_LisParty_94019a11:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que te equivocas. No me considero entre los hombres más afortunados del mundo. Estoy en la cima de los hombres más afortunados."
    mc "*Laugh* I think you're wrong. I don't consider myself among the luckiest men in the world. I'm at the very top of the luckiest men's pyramid."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:119
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c9cadba7:

    # lis "*Risa* ¿Entiendes ahora por qué estoy con él?"
    lis "*Laugh* Do you understand now why I'm with him?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:120
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c2983f37:

    # sid "La verdad es que no es una respuesta que me esperara. *Risa* Pero si siempre es así, consérvalo cerca."
    sid "Honestly, that's not the answer I expected. *Laugh* But if he's always like that, keep him close."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:121
translate english c29s001_LisParty_155c3f74:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso espero."
    mc "*Laugh* I hope so."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:123
translate english c29s001_LisParty_65070f98:

    # lis "¡Oh! ¡Acabo de ver a Jenny! ¿Ha venido disfrazada?"
    lis "Oh! I just saw Jenny! Did she come in costume?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:124
translate english c29s001_LisParty_45ee02db:

    # sid "No. O puede que sí... Ha venido directamente de una sesión de fotos para su nueva serie."
    sid "No. Or maybe she did... She came straight from a photoshoot for her new show."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:126
translate english c29s001_LisParty_688ebfb8:

    # lis "Cuida de [mc] un rato, Sid. Voy a saludar a Jenny y la traigo para que la conozca."
    lis "Watch [mc] for a bit, Sid. I'm going to say hi to Jenny and bring her over so he can meet her."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:127
translate english c29s001_LisParty_16d832f3:

    # lis "*Risa* Que no se acerque ninguna pelandrusca a mi novio."
    lis "*Laugh* Don't let any hussies near my boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:128
translate english c29s001_LisParty_43c0ed37:

    # sid "No te preocupes. *Risa* Defenderé su honor con mis garras."
    sid "Don't worry. *Laugh* I'll defend his honor with my claws."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:131
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a3398586:

    # lis "Espérame aquí con Sidney. Vuelvo en un minuto."
    lis "Wait for me here with Sidney. I'll be back in a minute."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:132
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3173a809:

    # mc "No te preocupes. *Risa* Intentaré no aburrirla."
    mc "Don't worry. *Laugh* I'll try not to bore her."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:135
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7483f194:

    # "Te acercas al bar con Sidney. Siempre te ha parecido estúpido cuando veías un bar completo en las películas sobre mansiones. Es la primera vez que lo ves fuera de la tele."
    "You approach the bar with Sidney. You always thought it looked stupid when you saw a full bar in movies about mansions. This is the first time you've seen one outside of TV."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:136
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e3e1bf5d:

    # sid "Así que tú eres el chico de [lis]. Cuando me escribió para decirme que vendría con alguien casi no me lo podía creer."
    sid "So, you're [lis]'s guy. When she wrote to tell me she was coming with someone, I almost couldn't believe it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:138
translate english c29s001_LisParty_82cf0183:

    # mcp "(No tengo ni idea de qué sabe sobre nosotros, la familia o el harén... Será mejor no dar ninguna información relevante.)"
    mcp "(I have no idea what she knows about us, the family, or the harem... It's better not to give away any relevant information.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:140
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0c0d671f:

    # mcp "(No tengo ni idea de qué sabe sobre nosotros o la familia... Será mejor no dar ninguna información relevante.)"
    mcp "(I have no idea what she knows about us or the family... It's better not to give away any relevant information.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:141
translate english c29s001_LisParty_aada82dd:

    # mc "Creo que si nos lo hubieran dicho a cualquiera de nosotros hace menos de un mes tampoco nos lo hubiéramos creído."
    mc "I think if anyone had told us this less than a month ago, we wouldn't have believed it either."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:143
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7cef4d48:

    # sid "¿Hace mucho que tú y ella os conocéis?"
    sid "Have you and she known each other for a long time?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:144
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7f404c0c:

    # mc "*Risa* Menos de un mes."
    mc "*Laugh* Less than a month."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:146
translate english c29s001_LisParty_10246c7b:

    # sid "*Risa* Veo que tienes sentido del humor. Lo vas a necesitar con [lis]."
    sid "*Laugh* I see you have a sense of humor. You're going to need it with [lis]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:147
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0f4813ed:

    # sid "A veces necesita a alguien que le pare los pies cuando se emociona mucho con algo. Y siempre es mejor hacerlo con sentido del humor."
    sid "Sometimes she needs someone to keep her grounded when she gets too excited about something. And it's always better to do it with a sense of humor."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:148
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d4c5bc55:

    # mc "No te preocupes por eso. Mi función no es frenarle, sino acompañarla y animarla para que llegue a la meta que se ha marcado."
    mc "Don't worry about that. My role isn't to keep her grounded, but to accompany and encourage her, so she reaches the goals she has set."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:149
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9a299d2c:

    # mc "Por cierto, me gusta tu piso."
    mc "By the way, I like your apartment."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:151
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d495a0d3:

    # sid "Gracias. Es muy chulo, pero esta es precisamente la fiesta de despedida de este piso."
    sid "Thanks. It's really cool, but this is actually the farewell party for this apartment."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:152
translate english c29s001_LisParty_49489061:

    # mc "¿Dejas el piso? Es una pasada de sitio, y [lis] me ha dicho que tienes piscina arriba."
    mc "Are you leaving the apartment? It's an amazing place, and [lis] told me you have a pool upstairs."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:153
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a3fa4c8e:

    # sid "El sitio me gusta, pero es de alquiler. Pertenece a un productor británico y la distribución no es la mejor. El bar ocupa demasiado sitio y no lo puedo quitar."
    sid "I like the place, but it's a rental. It belongs to a British producer, and the layout isn't the best. The bar takes up too much space and I can't remove it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:155
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a1468165:

    # sid "Este piso está pensado para dar fiestas más que para vivir. Me compré una casa el año pasado y, ahora que las reformas están acabadas, me mudaré ahí."
    sid "This apartment is designed more for throwing parties than for living in. I bought a house last year, and now that the renovations are finished, I'm moving there."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:156
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c569f646:

    # sid "Ya me he llevado muchas cosas y ahora este piso me da la sensación de... vacío. La casa nueva es mucho más tranquila que este sitio, y más apartada."
    sid "I've already moved a lot of things out, and now this apartment feels... empty. The new house is much quieter than this place, and more secluded."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:157
translate english c29s001_LisParty_94948ae3:

    # mc "El precio de la fama, supongo. Algo con lo que espero no tener que lidiar nunca."
    mc "The price of fame, I guess. Something I hope I never have to deal with."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:159
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1f5f3556:

    # sid "Tiene sus partes buenas y sus partes malas. Aunque hay más partes buenas que malas."
    sid "It has its good parts and its bad parts. Although there are more good parts than bad."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:160
translate english c29s001_LisParty_b15b0059:

    # mc "Me lo imagino. Si no, la gente huiría de la fama."
    mc "I imagine so. Otherwise, people would run away from fame."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:161
translate english c29s001_LisParty_fd95efb8:

    # mc "Por cierto, creía que habría más gente. [lis] habló de 60 o 70 personas."
    mc "By the way, I thought there would be more people. [lis] mentioned 60 or 70 people."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:163
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5a485bd6:

    # sid "Hay 80 personas invitadas, pero no vendrán todas ni coincidirán a la vez aquí. La gente va y viene, pero menos de la mitad estarán durante toda la fiesta."
    sid "There are 80 invited guests, but they won't all come or be here at the same time. People come and go, but less than half will stay for the entire party."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:164
translate english c29s001_LisParty_31232478:

    # sid "Además, arriba en la azotea y en la piscina hay mucha gente ahora mismo. Hace buena noche y la gente quiere aprovechar y estar al aire libre."
    sid "Also, there are a lot of people upstairs on the rooftop and by the pool right now. It's a nice evening and people want to take advantage of that and be outdoors."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:165
translate english c29s001_LisParty_838aabed:

    # mc "Tienes razón, no había pensado que hubiera mucha gente en la piscina a estas horas."
    mc "You're right, I hadn't thought about there being a lot of people in the pool at this time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:167
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e4ce73e0:

    # sid "Por cierto, ¿a qué te dedicas, [mc]? [lis] no me ha dicho nada sobre ti excepto que existes."
    sid "By the way, what do you do, [mc]? [lis] hasn't told me anything about you except that you exist."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:168
translate english c29s001_LisParty_cad631e2:

    # mc "Mi familia tiene una empresa de alojamiento para universitarias. La hemos fundado este año."
    mc "My family owns a housing company for university students. We founded it this year."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:169
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d7787222:

    # mc "*Risa* [lis] diría que soy el botones, pero soy el director financiero, entre otras cosas."
    mc "*Laugh* [lis] would say I'm the bellhop, but I'm the financial director, among other things."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:171
translate english c29s001_LisParty_8d340300:

    # sid "¡Oh, que interesante! ¿Es ahí donde conociste a [lis]?"
    sid "Oh, how interesting! Is that where you met [lis]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:172
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e4854777:

    # sid "Hace un par de meses me dijo que se mudaría a un pueblo de la costa a estudiar. Según ella, 'como una chica normal'."
    sid "A couple of months ago, she told me she was moving to a coastal town to study. According to her, 'like a normal girl'."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:173
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6862b974:

    # sid "Supongo que su familia podría comprar la universidad entera, o como mínimo una mansión donde vivir mientras estudia."
    sid "I suppose her family could buy the entire university, or at least a mansion to live in while she studies."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:174
translate english c29s001_LisParty_79a45be1:

    # mc "Sí, [lis] se aloja en la residencia. Es la casa donde he vivido casi toda mi vida."
    mc "Yes, [lis] is staying at the dorm. It's the house where I've lived almost my entire life."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:175
translate english c29s001_LisParty_fd195d7d:

    # mc "El ambiente es muy... familiar. Mi hermana y mi madre también viven ahí, y mi tía y mis primas en la casa de al lado, que también pertenece a la residencia."
    mc "The atmosphere is very... family-like. My sister and mother also live there, and my aunt and cousins live in the house next door, which also belongs to the dorm."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:177
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6f4ed15f:

    # mc "(*Risa mental* Si te tuviera que explicar que no estamos relacionados, seguramente te explotaría la cabeza y acabaría la fiesta.)"
    mc "(*Mental laughter* If I had to explain to you that we aren't related, your head would probably explode and the party would end.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:179
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f775a5d2:

    # sid "Mmmm... Al decir una empresa de alojamiento, creía que tendríais varios edificios en diversas universidades."
    sid "Mmmm... When you said a housing company, I thought you would have several buildings at different universities."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:180
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c250229d:

    # mc "Todo llegará. Como te he dicho, hemos empezado este año."
    mc "It will happen in time. As I said, we just started this year."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:182
translate english c29s001_LisParty_81bee7ce:

    # sid "¡Oh, no me malinterpretes! No soy de las personas que juzgan a otras por el tamaño de su cuenta bancaria."
    sid "Oh, don't misunderstand me! I'm not one of those people who judge others by the size of their bank account."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:183
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c22e46a6:

    # sid "Aquí en Hollywood todo parece moverse por el dinero y la fama, pero yo me crie en el Idaho rural."
    sid "Here in Hollywood, everything seems to revolve around money and fame, but I grew up in rural Idaho."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:184
translate english c29s001_LisParty_52d80627:

    # mc "No te estaba malinterpretando, no te preocupes. Tan solo aclaraba ese punto. No quiero parecer un tipo que tiene un hotel y dice que tiene una cadena."
    mc "I wasn't misunderstanding you, don't worry. I was just clarifying that point. I don't want to look like a guy who owns one hotel and claims he has a chain."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:185
translate english c29s001_LisParty_52feb7aa:

    # mc "Para nosotros ahora mismo es más importante que las chicas se sientan bien que cualquier otra cosa. Es a lo que me refería con ambiente familiar."
    mc "For us right now, it's more important that the girls feel comfortable than anything else. That's what I meant by a family-like atmosphere."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:189
translate english c29s001_LisParty_189f97dd:

    # sid "Mira, por ahí vuelve [lis] con Jenny. Voy a dejarte; tengo más invitados a los que debo atender."
    sid "Look, [lis] is coming back with Jenny. I'm going to leave you; I have more guests I need to attend to."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:190
translate english c29s001_LisParty_836c1691:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Encantado de conocerte."
    mc "Don't worry. It was nice to meet you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:191
translate english c29s001_LisParty_418e3e02:

    # sid "Igualmente. Pasáoslo bien."
    sid "Likewise. Have fun."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:193
translate english c29s001_LisParty_43502c32:

    # lis "¿Ya se ha ido Sid? ¿Te ha dejado solo?"
    lis "Has Sid left already? Did she leave you alone?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:194
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2b7c6072:

    # mc "Se acaba de ir. Ha esperado a ver que ya volvías."
    mc "She just left. She waited until she saw you were coming back."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:195
translate english c29s001_LisParty_4f769a1b:

    # lis "Bueno, te presento a Jenny. Este es [mc], mi novio."
    lis "Well, let me introduce you to Jenny. This is [mc], my boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:196
translate english c29s001_LisParty_8216a1aa:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte, Jenny."
    mc "Nice to meet you, Jenny."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:197
translate english c29s001_LisParty_266f381e:

    # jen "Lo mismo digo, [mc]."
    jen "Same here, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:199
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ead44969:

    # jen "Veo que a nuestras altísimas amigas les ha sentado bien venir a California. No llevan un mes aquí y ya están las dos emparejadas."
    jen "I see that coming to California has suited our very tall friends well. They haven't been here even a month yet, and both of them are already paired up."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:201
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2d6ccfec:

    # "Entiendes por el gesto de [lis] que Jenny no sabe que las dos están emparejadas contigo."
    "You understand from [lis]'s gesture that Jenny doesn't know that both of them are paired up with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:202
translate english c29s001_LisParty_af24240d:

    # mc "Cada una de ellas ha encontrado un tipo afortunado."
    mc "Each of them has found a lucky guy."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:204
translate english c29s001_LisParty_83bb5b5e:

    # lis "Aún no estoy segura de quién es más afortunado. Si nosotras o nuestro novio... Nuestros novios..."
    lis "I'm still not sure who is luckier. If it's us or our boyfriend... Our boyfriends..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:206
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c17d5949:

    # jen "Veo que a nuestra altísima amiga le ha sentado bien venir a California. No lleva un mes aquí y ya está emparejada."
    jen "I see that coming to California has suited our very tall friend well. She hasn't been here even a month yet, and she's already paired up."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:207
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c9060efd:

    # mc "[lis] ha encontrado a un tipo afortunado."
    mc "[lis] has found a lucky guy."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:209
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f2acd914:

    # lis "Aún no estoy segura de quién es más afortunado. Si él o yo."
    lis "I'm still not sure who is luckier. If it's him or me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:210
translate english c29s001_LisParty_294ed5b5:

    # jen "*Risa* ¡Qué bonita es una relación cuando empieza!"
    jen "*Laugh* How beautiful a relationship is when it starts!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:211
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1feac208:

    # mc "*Risa* Espero no poder compararla nunca con cómo es cuando acaba."
    mc "*Laugh* I hope I never have to compare it to how it is when it ends."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:213
translate english c29s001_LisParty_8ae9094d:

    # jen "*Risa* Chica, mantén a este hombre cerca. Parece que él no tiene intención de dejarte escapar."
    jen "*Laugh* Girl, keep this man close. It looks like he has no intention of letting you get away."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:214
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7e0454d0:

    # lis "*Risita* Ya ha visto una de las peores partes de mí y eso no le ha asustado, con lo que..."
    lis "*Giggle* He has already seen one of the worst parts of me, and that hasn't scared him off, so..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:215
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d17a656e:

    # jen "¿Una de tus peores partes? *Risa* ¿Cuál? ¡Tienes muchísimas!"
    jen "One of your worst parts? *Laugh* Which one? You have so many!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:216
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6998b61e:

    # lis "*Risa* Eres una perra mala, Jenny."
    lis "*Laugh* You're such a bitch, Jenny."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:217
translate english c29s001_LisParty_04cdd0ca:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿De verdad tienes partes malas, [lis]?"
    mc "*Laugh* Do you really have bad parts, [lis]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:219
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e2b75e16:

    # jen "Chicos, me alegro de haberos visto, pero he quedado con Saoirse arriba en la piscina y se estará preguntando dónde estoy."
    jen "Guys, I'm glad I saw you, but I'm meeting Saoirse upstairs by the pool and she's probably wondering where I am."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:220
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ee3e000d:

    # lis "¿Saoirse ha venido? ¡No sabía que iba a venir!"
    lis "Saoirse is here? I didn't know she was coming!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:221
translate english c29s001_LisParty_49917b6c:

    # jen "Suspendieron el rodaje porque uno de los actores se ha roto una mano. ¿Por qué no vienes? Seguro que se alegra de verte."
    jen "They suspended filming because one of the actors broke a hand. Why don't you come? I'm sure she'll be happy to see you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:223
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a55935a6:

    # lis "No quiero dejarte solo otra vez... ¿Subes a la piscina con nosotras?"
    lis "I don't want to leave you alone again... Are you coming up to the pool with us?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:224
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e720b56e:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Ve a saludar a tus amigas y te espero aquí, en la barra. Empiezo a tener algo de sed."
    mc "Don't worry. Go say hello to your friends and I'll wait for you here, at the bar. I'm starting to get thirsty."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:226
translate english c29s001_LisParty_8216a1aa_1:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte, Jenny."
    mc "It was nice to meet you, Jenny."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:227
translate english c29s001_LisParty_84124514:

    # jen "Igualmente, [mc]. Siento robarte a tu novia, pero solo será un rato."
    jen "Likewise, [mc]. Sorry for stealing your girlfriend, but it will only be for a little while."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:228
translate english c29s001_LisParty_4c4d4878:

    # mc "No te preocupes por eso."
    mc "Don't worry about it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:231
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5fa82abd:

    # lis "¡Eres el mejor novio del mundo!"
    lis "You are the best boyfriend in the world!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:232
translate english c29s001_LisParty_30ac6a47:

    # mc "*Risa* Y estaré aquí mismo, en la barra esperando a la mejor novia del mundo. Bueno, mejor aún en ese rincón."
    mc "*Laugh* And I'll be right here, at the bar waiting for the best girlfriend in the world. Well, in that corner."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:234
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6e77fb75:

    # "Te diriges al camarero y pides un zumo de piña. No te apetece beber solo."
    "You head to the bartender and order a pineapple juice. You don't feel like drinking alone."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:235
translate english c29s001_LisParty_aeca0d27:

    # "Al cabo de un rato..."
    "After a while..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:236
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d5a26e97:

    # wom "¡Hey, yo te conozco!"
    wom "Hey, I know you!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:238
translate english c29s001_LisParty_228014cc:

    # mc "Hola... No recuerdo tu nombre. Nos vimos en el aeropuerto de San Luis hace un mes más o menos."
    mc "Hello... I don't recall your name. We saw each other at the San Luis airport about a month ago."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:239
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f4ed3db8:

    # olg "Olga. Es verdad, tu eras el que venía a recoger a aquella chica tan guapa... ¿Kim? ¿Kelly?"
    olg "Olga. That's right, you were the one who came to pick up that beautiful girl... Kim? Kelly?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:240
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1fb8da12:

    # mc "[kim]. Soy [mc]."
    mc "[kim]. I'm [mc]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:241
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f5e5de13:

    # olg "Encantado de conocerte, [mc]. *Risa* Conocerte por segunda vez, claro."
    olg "Nice to meet you, [mc]. *Laugh* Meet you for the second time, of course."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:242
translate english c29s001_LisParty_72baf4a9:

    # mc "Igualmente, Olga."
    mc "Likewise, Olga."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:244
translate english c29s001_LisParty_83a38109:

    # olg "¿Te importa si te hago compañía? Mi jefa estará ocupada un rato. Supongo que a quién hayas traído tú también."
    olg "Do you mind if I keep you company? My boss will be busy for a while. I assume whoever you brought here is busy too."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:245
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f320d15d:

    # mc "No sé a lo que te refieres..."
    mc "I don't know what you mean..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:247
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f6eb3c6b:

    # olg "He supuesto que eras chófer o algo así... Si fuiste a buscar a [kim], y hoy estás aquí bebiendo un zumo..."
    olg "I assumed you were a driver or something... If you went to pick up [kim], and today you're here drinking juice..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:248
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7fdff375:

    # mc "*Risa* Oh, no. He venido con mi novia. Es amiga de la anfitriona."
    mc "*Laugh* Oh, no. I came with my girlfriend. She's a friend of the host."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:250
translate english c29s001_LisParty_60ce5514:

    # olg "¡Oops! Perdón."
    olg "Oops! Sorry."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:251
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6e4d595f:

    # mc "No te preocupes. La confusión es normal. ¿Así que trabajas para alguien en esta fiesta?"
    mc "Don't worry about it. The confusion is normal. So, you work for someone at this party?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:253
translate english c29s001_LisParty_012159c6:

    # olg "Sí, soy su asistente personal. Pero me aburren estas fiestas."
    olg "Yes, I'm her personal assistant. But these parties bore me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:254
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d88fa85b:

    # mc "Supongo que lo de conocer a ricos y famosos deja de ser interesante al tercero o al cuarto."
    mc "I guess meeting the rich and famous stops being interesting after the third or fourth time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:256
translate english c29s001_LisParty_516ea2ab:

    # olg "*Risa* Exacto. Acaba siendo más interesante hablar con las personas que los rodean."
    olg "*Laugh* Exactly. It ends up being more interesting to talk to the people surrounding them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:257
translate english c29s001_LisParty_49a1eb43:

    # olg "A menos que seas muy fan de alguien, claro."
    olg "Unless you're a huge fan of someone, of course."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:258
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f313b5c9:

    # mc "No es mi caso, pero estoy seguro de que una de mis primas estaría totalmente embobada."
    mc "That's not my case, but I'm sure one of my cousins would be totally starstruck."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:259
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e87d582f:

    # mc "Hace un rato he visto a Taylor Shift. Es su cantante favorita."
    mc "A little while ago I saw Taylor Shift. She's her favorite singer."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:261
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e00d2266:

    # olg "Mírala. Ahí está."
    olg "Look, there she is."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:262
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3018769e:

    # mc "¿La otra chica es...?"
    mc "Is the other girl...?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:263
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3cc9f3c5:

    # olg "Sí, es ella. Una chica muy maja."
    olg "Yes, that's her. A very nice girl."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:264
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7366607d:

    # mc "Pues ahora mi prima estaría embobada totalmente. Sus dos cantantes favoritas en el mismo lugar."
    mc "Well, now my cousin would be totally starstruck. Her two favorite singers in the same place."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:266
translate english c29s001_LisParty_b3429eed:

    # olg "¿Quieres que les diga que quieres hacerte una selfie con ellas para enviársela a tu prima?"
    olg "Do you want me to tell them you want to take a selfie with them to send to your cousin?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:267
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1499b1ae:

    # mc "No hace falta. No soy una persona muy de selfies ni de famosos. *Risa* Con decirle a [dap] que he estado en la misma fiesta que ellas se morirá de envidia."
    mc "That won't be necessary. I'm not much for selfies or celebrities. *Laugh* Just telling [dap] that I was at the same party as them will make her die of envy."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:268
translate english c29s001_LisParty_86079a21:

    # mc "Además, creo que este tipo de gente, los famosos, no vienen a estas fiestas a que los fans se hagan fotos con ellos."
    mc "Besides, I think these kinds of people, celebrities, don't come to these parties for fans to take pictures with them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:270
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a050c391:

    # olg "Es cierto que no les suele gustar, pero conozco a las dos, y seguramente no les importaría si se lo pidiera."
    olg "It's true that they usually don't like it, but I know both of them, and they probably wouldn't mind if I asked."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:271
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9ba930e8:

    # olg "Sobre todo, si les digo que has venido desde San Luis. Eso deben ser... ¿Cuánto? ¿4 o 5 horas conduciendo?"
    olg "Especially if I tell them you came all the way from San Luis. That must be... What? 4 or 5 hours driving?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:272
translate english c29s001_LisParty_32283a60:

    # mc "Más o menos, pero no vengo de San Luis, sino de Newport. Una ciudad cercana."
    mc "More or less, but I'm not from San Luis, I'm from Newport. A nearby city."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:274
translate english c29s001_LisParty_223cfb27:

    # olg "¿De Newport? ¡Mi hermana y mi hermano viven allí! Bueno, mis medio-hermanos..."
    olg "From Newport? My sister and my brother live there! Well, my half-siblings..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:275
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6d6228be:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que tú y yo estamos destinados a algo. Son demasiadas casualidades, ¿no?"
    mc "*Laugh* I think you and I are destined for something. It's too many coincidences, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:277
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9d6fc455:

    # olg "*Risa* Tienes razón. Nos hemos encontrado un par de veces en sitios donde ninguno de los dos vivimos."
    olg "*Laugh* You're right. We've run into each other a couple of times in places where neither of us live."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:278
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2cb5ca5f:

    # olg "Y mi familia vive en la misma ciudad que tú. Lo que sería una casualidad tremenda es que los conocieras."
    olg "And my family lives in the same city as you. It would be a huge coincidence if you knew them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:279
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c7554716:

    # mc "*Risa* Newport no es Los Angeles, pero tampoco es un pueblo de cien habitantes. No conozco a todo el mundo en la ciudad."
    mc "*Laugh* Newport isn't Los Angeles, but it's not a town with a hundred inhabitants either. I don't know everyone in the city."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:280
translate english c29s001_LisParty_98762c14:

    # mc "Además, he estado fuera unos años, estudiando en Portland."
    mc "Besides, I've been away for a few years, studying in Portland."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:282
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f267babd:

    # olg "Bueno, creo que me toca irme. Por ahí viene mi jefa."
    olg "Well, I think it's time for me to go. Here comes my boss."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:283
translate english c29s001_LisParty_21ac95f6:

    # mc "Encantado de volverte a ver, aunque haya sido para un encuentro casi tan breve como la última vez."
    mc "It was great seeing you again, even if it was for an encounter almost as brief as the last time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:284
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2cac3785:

    # olg "Igualmente, [mc]. Si algún día voy a visitar a mis hermanos, seguro que no nos encontramos."
    olg "Likewise, [mc]. If I ever go visit my siblings, I'm sure we won't run into each other."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:285
translate english c29s001_LisParty_31665faf:

    # mc "*Risa* Apunta mi teléfono si quieres y cuando vayas, llámame."
    mc "*Laugh* Write down my number if you want, and call me when you go."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:287
translate english c29s001_LisParty_db15a403:

    # olg "Creo que prefiero que sigan siendo encuentros casuales. *Risa* Si planeamos algo podríamos perder nuestra magia."
    olg "I think I prefer them to remain casual encounters. *Laugh* If we plan something, we might lose our magic."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:288
translate english c29s001_LisParty_155c8cc2:

    # mc "*Risa* Como quieras. Hasta el próximo encuentro casual."
    mc "*Laugh* Whatever works for you. Until the next casual encounter."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:290
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0adc3382:

    # hal "Hola. ¿Interrumpo algo?"
    hal "Hello. Am I interrupting something?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:292
translate english c29s001_LisParty_7ea4f864:

    # olg "No, Halley. Este es [mc]. Esta es Halley, mi jefa."
    olg "No, Halley. This is [mc]. This is Halley, my boss."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:293
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1fe6d187:

    # hal "Hola, [mc]. ¿Te importa si te robo a mi asistente?"
    hal "Hello, [mc]. Do you mind if I steal my assistant back?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:294
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c6a78234:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte, Halley. Y no te preocupes, Olga es tu asistente, al fin y al cabo."
    mc "Nice to meet you, Halley. And don't worry, Olga is your assistant, after all."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:296
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0ee44f2f:

    # hal "Nos podemos ir cuando quieras. O puedes quedarte, si lo prefieres."
    hal "We can leave whenever you want. Or you can stay, if you prefer."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:297
translate english c29s001_LisParty_308a290d:

    # olg "No hace falta. Podemos irnos. *Risita* [mc] y yo preferimos los encuentros breves."
    olg "It's not necessary. We can go. *Giggle* [mc] and I prefer brief encounters."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:299
translate english c29s001_LisParty_360c4275:

    # olg "Bueno, [mc]. Hasta la próxima, ya sea en Newport, Nueva York, o en una isla del Caribe."
    olg "Well, [mc]. Until next time, whether it's in Newport, New York, or a Caribbean island."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:300
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5d013122:

    # mc "Hasta la próxima, Olga. Cuídate."
    mc "Until next time, Olga. Take care."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:302
translate english c29s001_LisParty_eed5c47f:

    # hal "Hasta otra, [mc]."
    hal "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:303
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f9df8820:

    # mc "Hasta otra, Halley."
    mc "See you later, Halley."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:305
translate english c29s001_LisParty_b2bdf5dd:

    # "Vuelves a quedarte solo en la barra. Pides otro zumo de piña."
    "You are left alone at the bar again. You order another pineapple juice."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:306
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2b04c5d7:

    # "Aunque solo es relativo, ya que la gente va yendo y viniendo sin interactuar contigo."
    "Although 'alone' is relative, since people keep coming and going without interacting with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:307
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f2087289:

    # "Supones que los habituales de estas fiestas se lo deben estar pasando bien."
    "You suppose that the regulars at these parties must be having a good time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:308
translate english c29s001_LisParty_000cf23e:

    # "Pero esperabas algo diferente en tu primera cita con [lis]. Entiendes que no ha visto a sus amigas desde hace tiempo, pero te sientes solo y aburrido."
    "But you expected something different on your first date with [lis]. You understand she hasn't seen her friends in a while, but you feel lonely and bored."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:309
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1999e859:

    # "Cuando vas por el tercer zumo de piña..."
    "When you are on your third pineapple juice..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:311
translate english c29s001_LisParty_894ed6c9:

    # ska "¿No te gustan las fiestas?"
    ska "Don't you like these parties?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:312
translate english c29s001_LisParty_292ac2ed:

    # mc "No demasiado... ¡Oh! Eres Scarlett Johnson..."
    mc "Not really... Oh! You're Scarlett Johnson..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:314
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5272e16b:

    # ska "*Risa* Sí, la última vez que lo comprobé, esa era yo."
    ska "*Laugh* Yes, last time I checked, that was me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:315
translate english c29s001_LisParty_95acdeab:

    # mc "Perdona. No estoy acostumbrado a estos ambientes. Ni a cruzarme con cantantes y actores cada dos minutos."
    mc "Sorry. I'm not used to these environments. Nor running into singers and actors every two minutes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:316
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5b8c892d:

    # mc "*Risa* Supongo que se me pasará dentro de cuatro o cinco famosos más."
    mc "*Laugh* I guess it will pass after four or five more celebrities."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:317
translate english c29s001_LisParty_31a34033:

    # ska "*Risa* Hay gente a la que no se le pasa nunca. Pero es mejor acostumbrarse."
    ska "*Laugh* Some people never get used to it. But it's better to adapt."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:318
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2e28ad86:

    # mc "Soy [mc]. *Risa* No soy famoso."
    mc "I'm [mc]. *Laugh* I'm not famous."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:320
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a9c71ca8:

    # ska "Déjame adivinar. Supongo que alguien te ha traído a esta fiesta en la que no conoces a nadie y te ha dejado solo."
    ska "Let me guess. Someone brought you to this party where you don't know anyone and left you alone."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:321
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9084df31:

    # mc "Mas o menos. Mi novia es amiga de Sidney y de algunas otras personas aquí. Hacía tiempo que no las veía y se están poniendo al día."
    mc "More or less. My girlfriend is friends with Sidney and some other people here. She hadn't seen them in a while and they are catching up."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:322
translate english c29s001_LisParty_93a851c8:

    # ska "Y, como es la primera vez que vienes a una fiesta de estas, no sabes con quién hablar."
    ska "And, since this is your first time at one of these parties, you don't know who to talk to."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:323
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c1edb5c4:

    # mc "Ni con quién, ni de qué hablar. No creo que tenga muchos intereses en común con el 90%% de gente en esta fiesta."
    mc "Neither who, nor what to talk about. I don't think I have many interests in common with 90%% of the people at this party."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:324
translate english c29s001_LisParty_769f95ba:

    # mc "¡Hey! *Risa* ¡Pero estoy hablando con Scarlett Johnson!"
    mc "Hey! *Laugh* But I'm talking to Scarlett Johnson!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:325
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e120103f:

    # mcp "(Y conozco a alguien que podría ser tu relevo haciendo de Natasha. Es un papel en el que [eva] encajaría perfectamente.)"
    mcp "(And I know someone who could be your replacement playing Natasha. It's a role [eva] would be perfect for.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:327
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1fa3f870:

    # ska "*Risa* Con la que seguramente no tengas muchos intereses en común."
    ska "*Laugh* With whom you probably don't have many interests in common."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:328
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3069ddbb:

    # mc "*Risa* Touché."
    mc "*Laugh* Touché."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:330
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ed7786b7:

    # ska "La mayoría de nosotros somos personas normales, o intentamos seguir comportándonos como recordamos que hacíamos antes de todo esto."
    ska "Most of us are normal people, or we try to keep behaving as we were before all this."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:331
translate english c29s001_LisParty_720e483a:

    # ska "Encontrarás unos cuantos que creen que por haber alcanzado la fama son especiales, pero no deja de ser un trabajo."
    ska "You'll find a few who believe that because they achieved fame, they are special, but it's still just a job."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:332
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2d16feef:

    # mc "No te ofendas, pero ¿a qué edad empezaste a actuar? ¿Realmente recuerdas cómo era una vida normal antes de eso?"
    mc "No offense, but how old were you when you started acting? Do you really remember what a normal life was like before that?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:334
translate english c29s001_LisParty_05fd065f:

    # ska "*Risa* Ahora es mi turno de decir 'Touché'. No hay mucha gente que piense en eso."
    ska "*Laugh* Now it's my turn to say 'Touché'. Not many people think about that."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:335
translate english c29s001_LisParty_36f62228:

    # mc "Creo que te he visto actuando desde que nací. Es lógico pensar en eso."
    mc "I think I've watched you acting since I was born. It's logical to think that way."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:337
translate english c29s001_LisParty_676f94bf:

    # ska "*Risa* ¡No soy tan vieja!"
    ska "*Laugh* I'm not that old!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:338
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ff8e2efe:

    # mc "*Risa* Y yo no soy tan viejo como parezco."
    mc "*Laugh* And I'm not as old as I look."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:340
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2e9bbaac:

    # ska "Mi primera película fue en 1994. ¿Dónde estabas tú entonces?"
    ska "My first movie was in 1994. Where were you then?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:341
translate english c29s001_LisParty_58aa581f:

    # mc "Creo que ni siquiera era un pensamiento en la mente de mis padres por entonces. Mi madre tenía 12 años."
    mc "I don't think I was even a thought in my parents' minds back then. My mother was 12."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:343
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c87abfee:

    # ska "*Risa* Me acabas de hacer sentir como un fósil. Como si no lo hicieran ya la mitad de las chicas en esta fiesta."
    ska "*Laugh* You just made me feel like a fossil. As if half the girls at this party weren't already doing that."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:344
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1f757312:

    # mc "*Risa* Te he dicho que te he visto actuando desde que nací..."
    mc "*Laugh* I told you I've been watching you act since I was born..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:345
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9403d4cd:

    # lis "Y mi novio nunca miente, Scarlett."
    lis "And my boyfriend never lies, Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:347
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1c1bc14e:

    # ska "¿Qué? ¿Tú eres la que has dejado solo a este chico durante tanto rato, [lis]?"
    ska "What? You're the one who left this guy alone for so long, [lis]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:348
translate english c29s001_LisParty_086960a9:

    # lis "No me hagas sentir culpable por eso. Ya me siento lo suficientemente mal."
    lis "Don't make me feel guilty about that. I already feel bad enough."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:349
translate english c29s001_LisParty_bddcc345:

    # lis "Además, así ha tenido la oportunidad de conocerte."
    lis "Besides, this way he had the chance to meet you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:351
translate english c29s001_LisParty_79f5e331:

    # ska "No sabía que ibas a venir. Si lo hubiera sabido, habría reservado más tiempo para esta fiesta."
    ska "I didn't know you were coming. If I had known, I would have set aside more time for this party."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:352
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d3191ac3:

    # ska "Y más aún si hubiera sabido que sales con este chico tan simpático. Pero me esperan en otro sitio."
    ska "And even more so if I had known you were dating this nice guy. But they are waiting for me somewhere else."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:353
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e3fe4cf6:

    # lis "Siempre estás super ocupada. Tienes que aprender a relajarte un poco."
    lis "You're always super busy. You need to learn to relax a little."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:355
translate english c29s001_LisParty_3a2f07ed:

    # ska "*Risa* El día que aprendas tú en qué diccionario tienes que buscar la palabra 'relajarse'."
    ska "*Laugh* The day you learn which dictionary you need to look up the word 'relax' in."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:356
translate english c29s001_LisParty_c8688883:

    # lis "*Risa* Creo que te podría dar consejos sobre dónde buscarla. Yo ya la he encontrado."
    lis "*Laugh* I think I could give you advice on where to look for it. I've already found it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:358
translate english c29s001_LisParty_201423a5:

    # ska "Déjame mirarte..."
    ska "Let me look at you..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:359
translate english c29s001_LisParty_eab16225:

    # ska "..."
    ska "..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:360
translate english c29s001_LisParty_96cb31fb:

    # ska "No me había fijado, pero tienes razón. Hay algo diferente en ti, algo que dice que estás mucho mejor que la última vez que te vi."
    ska "I hadn't noticed, but you're right. There's something different about you, something that says you're in a much better place than the last time I saw you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:361
translate english c29s001_LisParty_74abd93c:

    # ska "Y ese pelo... me encanta. La [lis] de hace tres meses nunca lo hubiera llevado así."
    ska "And that hair... I love it. The [lis] from three months ago would never have worn it like that."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:362
translate english c29s001_LisParty_4fa0bf7b:

    # lis "Estoy mucho mejor, Scarlett. Mudarme a Newport ha tenido efectos... inesperados."
    lis "I'm much better, Scarlett. Moving to Newport has had... unexpected effects."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:363
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a7f983ba:

    # mc "*Risa* También en Newport. El comercio de ropa se ha multiplicado en el último mes."
    mc "*Laugh* Also in Newport. Clothing sales have multiplied in the last month."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:365
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9e2c523d_1:

    # lis "*Risa* Idiota."
    lis "*Laugh* Idiot."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:366
translate english c29s001_LisParty_df828034:

    # ska "*Risa* Si este es el resultado, es algo bueno. Y no me refiero solo a algo bueno para el comercio local en Newport."
    ska "*Laugh* If this is the result, it's a good thing. And I don't just mean a good thing for local commerce in Newport."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:367
translate english c29s001_LisParty_11895ee4:

    # mc "*Risa* Hay un par de tiendas que están pensando en comprar alfombras rojas para cuando llega [lis]."
    mc "*Laugh* There are a couple of stores thinking about buying red carpets for when [lis] arrives."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:369
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d257d4c3:

    # ska "Chicos, me gustaría quedarme charlando con vosotros, pero ya os he dicho que me esperan en otro sitio."
    ska "Guys, I'd love to stay and chat with you, but as I already told you, I'm expected somewhere else."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:370
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ef70fc5b:

    # ska "Chris daba una fiesta también hoy. Solo para fósiles de más de 35."
    ska "Chris was throwing a party today too. Only for fossils over 35."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:371
translate english c29s001_LisParty_dabc054b:

    # lis "¿Prat o Evan? He visto a Hemswort por aquí hace un rato, con lo que no puede ser él. Bueno, da lo mismo. Me caen bien los dos. Dales un beso de mi parte."
    lis "Prat or Evan? I saw Hemswort around here a while ago, so it can't be him. Well, it doesn't matter. I like both of them. Give them a kiss for me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:372
translate english c29s001_LisParty_8e8f47a1:

    # mc "*Risa* No hace falta ni que los saludes de mi parte. Estoy seguro de que no se acordarán de mí."
    mc "*Laugh* You don't even need to say hi to them for me. I'm sure they won't remember me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:374
translate english c29s001_LisParty_4da31d28:

    # ska "¿Ya los has conocido? No me han dicho nada de que [lis] saliera con alguien."
    ska "You've met them already? They didn't tell me [lis] was dating someone."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:375
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1b22e0a8:

    # mc "*Risa* Nope. Por eso no se acordarán de mí."
    mc "*Laugh* Nope. That's why they won't remember me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:377
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0922c26d:

    # ska "*Risa* Me gusta el sentido del humor de tu novio."
    ska "*Laugh* I like your boyfriend's sense of humor."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:378
translate english c29s001_LisParty_28370279:

    # ska "Pero en serio, me tengo que ir o Chris me matará."
    ska "But seriously, I have to go or Chris will kill me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:379
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d7947a35:

    # lis "No te entretenemos más. Además, tengo que compensar a [mc] por dejarlo solo tanto rato."
    lis "We won't keep you any longer. Besides, I have to make it up to [mc] for leaving him alone for so long."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:381
translate english c29s001_LisParty_b7f40313:

    # ska "Cuida de esta chica. Es de las que valen la pena."
    ska "Take care of this girl. She's one of the good ones."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:382
translate english c29s001_LisParty_cb1928b7:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Lo haré. Y ahora vete antes de que cualquiera de los Chris te mate."
    mc "Don't worry. I will. Now go before one of the Chrises kills you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:385
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1a17c915:

    # lis "Siento haberte dejado solo. Quería volver, pero me he ido encontrando a gente y..."
    lis "I'm sorry I left you alone. I wanted to come back, but I kept running into people and..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:386
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d8f26b75:

    # mc "No te preocupes, lo entiendo. Hacía meses que no veías a tus amigas y querías saludarlas."
    mc "Don't worry, I get it. You hadn't seen your friends in months, and you wanted to catch up with them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:388
translate english c29s001_LisParty_6568d44b:

    # lis "Sí, pero también quería estar contigo. Esto no es lo que tenía pensado para la primera cita."
    lis "Yes, but I wanted to be with you too. This isn't what I had planned for our first date."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:389
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a16cd5dc:

    # mc "[lis], a veces las cosas no salen como las planeamos. Y habrá más citas."
    mc "[lis], sometimes things don't go as planned. And there will be more dates."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:391
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0752ae83:

    # lis "Pero nunca más habrá una primera cita..."
    lis "But there will never be a first date again..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:392
translate english c29s001_LisParty_dfce5d9d:

    # mc "Eso es fácil de arreglar. Te dejo."
    mc "That's easy to fix. I'm breaking up with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:394
translate english c29s001_LisParty_4f78a3e9:

    # lis "¿Qué?"
    lis "What?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:395
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ba82f3b4:

    # mc "¿Quieres salir conmigo?"
    mc "Do you want to go on a date with me?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:397
translate english c29s001_LisParty_4f78a3e9_1:

    # lis "¿Qué?"
    lis "What?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:398
translate english c29s001_LisParty_533c3583:

    # mc "Si dices que sí, podemos empezar nuestra segunda primera cita ahora mismo."
    mc "If you say yes, we can start our second first date right now."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:400
translate english c29s001_LisParty_5fa82abd_1:

    # lis "¡Eres el mejor novio del mundo!"
    lis "You're the best boyfriend in the world!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:401
translate english c29s001_LisParty_38c58766:

    # mc "*Risa* Ahora mismo sólo soy el mejor ex-novio del mundo. Aún no has dicho que sí."
    mc "*Laugh* Right now I'm just the best ex-boyfriend in the world. You haven't said yes yet."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:402
translate english c29s001_LisParty_76cb2aaa:

    # lis "¡Claro que quiero salir contigo!"
    lis "Of course I want to go on a date with you!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:404
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9ce55039:

    # "El alivio que la chica siente se refleja en cómo sus labios saludan a los tuyos."
    "The relief the girl feels is reflected in how her lips greet yours."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:405
translate english c29s001_LisParty_41682c14:

    # "Lo que ha empezado como una noche extraña cambia en un momento. A mejor."
    "What started as an awkward night changes in a moment. For the better."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:407
translate english c29s001_LisParty_a28953c2:

    # "Los famosos y los amigos de [lis] dejan de existir y parece que estáis solos en la fiesta mientras vuestras lenguas se entrelazan."
    "The celebrities and [lis]'s friends cease to exist, and it feels like you are alone at the party as your tongues intertwine."


# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:409
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ac1d45e6:

    # "Incluso la fiesta desaparece a vuestro alrededor. No hay piso. No hay música. No hay nada aparte de vosotros dos y de un largo beso."
    "Even the party disappears around you. There is no apartment. There is no music. There is nothing except the two of you and a long kiss."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:410
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1107fc5a:

    # "Vuestro mundo en ese momento solo está habitado por vosotros dos."
    "Your world at that moment is only inhabited by the two of you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:412
translate english c29s001_LisParty_820c46a5:

    # mc "Esta fiesta acaba de mejorar mucho."
    mc "This party just got a lot better."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:413
translate english c29s001_LisParty_e20c95b6:

    # lis "Gracias por dejarme... Y por volver a pedirme salir."
    lis "Thanks for breaking up with me... And for asking me out again."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:414
translate english c29s001_LisParty_b5f7e227:

    # mc "*Risa* No podía permitir que otro tipo se llevara a la chica más guapa de la fiesta ahora que estaba soltera de nuevo."
    mc "*Laugh* I couldn't let another guy take the prettiest girl at the party now that she was single again."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:416
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2895657c:

    # lis "*Risa* Pero que sea la última vez que me dejas. La próxima vez es posible que haya un cuchillo cerca."
    lis "*Laugh* But let this be the last time you break up with me. Next time there might be a knife nearby."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:417
translate english c29s001_LisParty_60ab4b40:

    # mc "No voy a tentar a la suerte una segunda vez. *Risa* Imagínate que hubieras dicho que no cuando te he pedido para salir."
    mc "I'm not going to push my luck a second time. *Laugh* Imagine if you said no when I asked you out."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:418
translate english c29s001_LisParty_daa0756b:

    # mc "Si quieres que esto acabe, tendrás que hacerlo tú."
    mc "If you want this to end, you'll have to be the one to do it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:420
translate english c29s001_LisParty_ae5b8e90:

    # lis "¿Querer que esto acabe? ¡Acaba de empezar!"
    lis "Want this to end? It's just started!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:422
translate english c29s001_LisParty_9cf72a99:

    # lis "Ven, quiero bailar contigo."
    lis "Come on, I want to dance with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:423
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f5271567:

    # mc "Me parece una buena idea."
    mc "That sounds like a good idea."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:425
translate english c29s001_LisParty_0a8a796b:

    # "Pasáis los siguientes minutos bailando en silencio, sin saber si lo hacéis al ritmo de la inexistente música."
    "You spend the next few minutes dancing in silence, unsure if you are moving to the rhythm of the nonexistent music."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:426
translate english c29s001_LisParty_1881c26b:

    # "No hace falta decir nada. Vuestros brazos alrededor del otro dicen todo lo necesario."
    "No words are needed. Your arms around each other say everything necessary."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:427
translate english c29s001_LisParty_fda42bcd:

    # "No os importa lo que hacen otras personas a vuestro alrededor, porque no hay nadie más."
    "You don't care what other people are doing around you, because there is no one else."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:428
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d039f828:

    # "Tú tienes tu mundo entre tus brazos. Un mundo que te abraza a su vez."
    "You hold your world in your arms. A world that embraces you in return."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:430
translate english c29s001_LisParty_f6c822b3:

    # "Pero todo lo bueno acaba y alguien entra en vuestra burbuja particular."
    "But all good things come to an end, and someone enters your private bubble."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:431
translate english c29s001_LisParty_2d68492c:

    # jen "[lis], vengo a despedirme."
    jen "[lis], I came to say goodbye."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:432
translate english c29s001_LisParty_d4fa3d47:

    # lis "¿Ya te vas? ¡Hace menos de una hora que he llegado! Casi no hemos tenido tiempo de hablar."
    lis "You're leaving already? I arrived less than an hour ago! We barely had time to talk."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:434
