    # mom "Le cuesta una barbaridad meterlo y sacarlo, con lo que iremos con el mío. Y sí, tiene batería."
    mom "It's incredibly difficult for her to pull it in and out, so we'll go in mine. And yes, the battery is charged."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1731
translate english c29s003_KatKiss_8b51e9f4:

    # mom "Te veo luego."
    mom "See you later."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1732
translate english c29s003_KatKiss_5e437787:

    # mc "Pasáoslo bien en la comida y las compras."
    mc "Have fun at lunch and shopping."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1746
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6cf35a58:

    # "Cuando se acerca la hora de ir a comer, vas a la cocina de [nor] a por las cosas del pícnic y conduces hasta el campus."
    "When it gets close to lunchtime, you go to [nor]'s kitchen for the picnic supplies and drive to the campus."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1748
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_760b91a0:

    # "Te diriges al área ajardinada de la universidad. Se te hace raro ser prácticamente el único hombre en el campus que no trabaja allí."
    "You head to the university's garden area. It feels strange to be practically the only man on campus who doesn't work there."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1749
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_8487764f:

    # "Siendo verano, esperabas que hubiera más chicos visitando a sus novias para disfrutar del soleado día, pero sólo has visto a un par de ellos."
    "Since it's summer, you expected there to be more guys visiting their girlfriends to enjoy the sunny day, but you've only seen a couple of them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1751
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_2330e931:

    # "Cuando llegas a la zona donde habías quedado con [kim], la ves sentada en un banco esperándote mientras lee un libro."
    "When you arrive at the area where you were meeting [kim], you see her sitting on a bench, waiting for you while reading a book."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1752
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0c28f627:

    # "Los dos habéis llegado antes de la hora acordada. Los dos tenéis ganas de pasar tiempo juntos."
    "You both arrived before the agreed time. You both are eager to spend time together."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1754
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_903c5f2f:

    # "Te acercas sin que se dé cuenta de tu presencia."
    "You approach without her noticing your presence."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1755
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_86f16256:

    # mc "Boo."
    mc "Boo."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1757
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_a6666380:

    # kim "*Risa* No me has asustado. Te he visto los pies... justo antes de que dijeras 'Boo'. Y el libro NO ha estado a punto de caerse."
    kim "*Laugh* You didn't scare me. I saw your feet... just before you said 'Boo'. And the book was NOT about to fall."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1758
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_82fd791c:

    # mc "*Risa* No era mi intención asustarte ni que el libro saliera volando. ¿Preparada para ir a comer?"
    mc "*Laugh* It wasn't my intention to scare you or make the book fly away. Ready to have lunch?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1761
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_44f1abc0:

    # kim "Ahora sí. Vamos, he encontrado un sitio chulo para comer."
    kim "Now I am. Come on, I found a cool spot for us to have the picnic."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1762
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_e87cf047:

    # mc "¿Sabes que estaba enfadado con esta universidad cuando estaba en el instituto?"
    mc "Do you know I was mad at this university when I was in high school?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1764
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_2662c006:

    # kim "¿Por qué? Tu padre trabajaba aquí..."
    kim "Why? Your dad worked here..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1765
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_5ca3f87a:

    # mc "*Risa* No tiene nada que ver con mi padre. Te pasas toda tu vida viendo pelis de universitarios tirados en el césped estudiando."
    mc "*Laugh* It was nothing to do with my dad. You spend your whole life watching movies about college students lying on the grass studying."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1766
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_f6f4508a:

    # mc "Y la universidad que tienes al lado de casa es solo para chicas y acabas yendo a Portland. No es el mejor clima para tirarse en el césped."
    mc "And the university next to your house is only for girls, and you end up going to Portland. It's not the best climate for lying on the grass."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1768
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6a44ac31:

    # kim "Te entiendo. Yo quería estudiar en Cleveland, pero acabé incluso más al norte que tú. Y con más frío."
    kim "I get it. I wanted to study in Cleveland, but I ended up even further north than you. And colder."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1769
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_8b8ea7e3:

    # mc "*Risa* Es verdad, vienes de Bellingham."
    mc "*Laugh* That's right, you came from Bellingham."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1770
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_e13b6718:

    # kim "Sí. Ahí hace frío de verdad."
    kim "Yeah. It's really cold there."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1772
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_f055bbbf:

    # kim "Pero si no hubieras ido a Portland, no habrías conocido a Saira y no hubierais tenido vuestra relación abierta."
    kim "But if you hadn't gone to Portland, you wouldn't have met [sai], and you wouldn't have had your open relationship."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1774
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_05c4883e:

    # kim "Y sin eso, lo más probable es que no hubiera harén y que no estuviéramos juntos."
    kim "And without that, it's highly likely there wouldn't be a harem, and we wouldn't be together."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1775
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_ad6de255:

    # mc "Visto así, tengo que estar agradecido de que esta universidad sea solo para chicas."
    mc "Looking at it that way, I have to be grateful that this university is only for girls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1776
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0f9d3c77:

    # mc "*Risa* Solo me ha hecho falta empezar a salir con una de las alumnas para poder tumbarme en el césped."
    mc "*Laugh* All it took was starting to date one of the students to be able to lie down on the grass."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1779
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b21225dc:

    # kim "*Risa* ¿Sólo con una?"
    kim "*Laugh* Only one?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1780
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_477f0758:

    # mc "Solo con una que importe en este momento."
    mc "Only one that matters right now."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1782
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_c00114a9:

    # kim "¿Siempre vas a intentar hacerme sentir especial?"
    kim "Are you always going to try to make me feel special?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1783
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_cc2e3c0d:

    # mc "El día que deje de intentarlo, dímelo. Y si dejo de conseguirlo, también deberías decírmelo."
    mc "The day I stop trying, let me know. And if I stop succeeding, you should tell me that too."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1784
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d9a9141d:

    # mc "Intentar algo y conseguirlo no siempre se dan la mano."
    mc "Trying something and succeeding don't always go hand in hand."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1786
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b1479b6b:

    # kim "Déjame recoger las cosas y nos vamos."
    kim "Let me pack up the stuff and we'll go."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1787
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6098eddb:

    # mc "¿Te ayudo?"
    mc "Can I help you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1788
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d9dd32a1:

    # kim "No hace falta. Ni siquiera te voy a pedir que me lleves la mochila."
    kim "No need. I'm not even going to ask you to carry my backpack."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1790
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_1a642686:

    # kim "Por cierto, hay muchas más cosas que puedes hacer aparte de tumbarte en el césped."
    kim "By the way, there are many more things you can do besides lying on the grass."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1791
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_8da74567:

    # mc "Y esta es una de las que más me gustan."
    mc "And this is one of the things I like the most."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1794
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6a769cca:

    # "Una vez llegáis al sitio escogido por [kim] y estiráis la manta..."
    "Once you arrive at the spot chosen by [kim] and spread out the blanket..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1795
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d2e04a56:

    # kim "Pues ya estamos aquí. ¿Qué ha preparado [mar]? ¡Me muero de hambre!"
    kim "Well, we're here. What did [mar] prepare? I'm starving!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1796
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_cf50d2ac:

    # mc "La verdad es que no lo he mirado. He cogido la cesta y he venido aquí directamente."
    mc "To be honest, I haven't looked. I grabbed the basket and came straight here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1798
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_c00b21c6:

    # "[kim] estira la mano hacia la cesta con la comida e interrumpe el gesto a medio camino con un pequeño espasmo."
    "[kim] reaches for the food basket and interrupts the gesture halfway through with a small spasm."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1799
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_28d30388:

    # mc "¿Pasa algo, [kim]?"
    mc "Is something wrong, [kim]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1801
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_aa296d48:

    # kim "Después de... lo que hicimos ayer... siento un pequeño dolor dependiendo que movimiento hago."
    kim "After... what we did yesterday... I feel a little pain depending on the movement I make."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1802
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b1cbf0d6:

    # kim "Al estirarme hacia la cesta me ha dado un pinchazo en... la parte baja de la barriga."
    kim "When I stretched toward the basket, I got a small pain in... the lower part of my stomach."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1803
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0423d5b0:

    # mc "¿Duele mucho? Has dicho un pequeño dolor, pero..."
    mc "Does it hurt a lot? You said a little pain, but..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1805
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_9b3df548:

    # kim "Pero mi cara ha dicho que no era pequeño, ¿verdad?"
    kim "But my face said it wasn't little, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1806
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_65f9676b:

    # mc "Sí..."
    mc "Yeah..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1807
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_1616aef4:

    # kim "[kat] me ha dicho lo mismo esta mañana, mientras me vestía para venir a clase. [sai] me ha dicho que desaparecerá hoy o mañana."
    kim "[kat] told me the same thing this morning, while I was getting dressed for class. [sai] told me it will disappear today or tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1808
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_c298d430:

    # mc "Espero que sea hoy en vez de mañana."
    mc "I hope it's today instead of tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1810
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_f6aa170d:

    # kim "Yo también. Cada vez que me da un pinchazo es un poco menos doloroso que el anterior, pero todavía duele."
    kim "Me too. Every time I get a sharp pain, it's a little less painful than the last one, but it still hurts."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1811
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_7a2f7317:

    # mc "Lo siento..."
    mc "I'm sorry..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1813
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_5d30dac8:

    # kim "No tienes que sentir nada. Lo hicimos juntos porque los dos lo deseábamos."
    kim "You don't have to be sorry. We did it together because we both wanted it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1814
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_ee1bd4ba:

    # mc "Lo sé, pero me jode que tengas que estar sufriendo uno o dos días por ello."
    mc "I know, but it sucks that you have to be suffering for a day or two because of it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1816
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_13af9aa4:

    # kim "Al menos [sai] dice que solo pasa una vez."
    kim "At least [sai] says it only happens once."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1817
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d6920920:

    # mc "*Risa* Si pasara cada vez, creo que la humanidad se extinguiría por falta de sexo."
    mc "*Laugh* If it happened every time, I think humanity would go extinct due to lack of sex."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1819
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_9b0c55c6:

    # kim "*Risa* No creas. Si este es el precio a pagar por lo de ayer, creo que lo pagaría cada vez."
    kim "*Laugh* Don't think so. If this is the price to pay for yesterday, I think I'd pay it every time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1820
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_c328fa8f:

    # mc "Mejor que no tengas que pagarlo. Pero has dicho que te tenías hambre. ¿Comemos?"
    mc "It's better if you don't have to pay it. But you said you were hungry. Shall we eat?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1821
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_323daddf:

    # kim "*Risa* Sí, por favor. No quieres verme hambrienta y dolorida a la vez. Puedo ser un poco cascarrabias."
    kim "*Laugh* Yes, please. You don't want to see me hungry and sore at the same time. I can be a little cranky."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1823
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6d3cda26:

    # "Coméis entre risas y bromas. La comida es interrumpida por besos de vez en cuando."
    "You eat amidst laughter and jokes. The meal is interrupted by kisses from time to time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1824
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_7ce1b4a2:

    # "No es el tipo de pícnic que recordabas, pero no lo cambiarías por los que hacías cuando eras un niño."
    "It's not the kind of picnic you remembered, but you wouldn't trade it for the ones you had when you were a child."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1825
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_ef63521a:

    # "Por un momento te imaginas este tipo de pícnic con Jamaal. Desagradable."
    "For a moment you imagine this kind of picnic with Jamaal. Disgusting."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1826
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_a4bc74d9:

    # "En la imagen mental, su silla de ruedas está encima de tus piernas."
    "In the mental image, his wheelchair is resting on your legs."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1829
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_f3d76e69:

    # "Al acabar de comer..."
    "After you finish eating..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1830
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d5592caf:

    # kim "Creo que ha sido el mejor pícnic de mi vida."
    kim "I think that was the best picnic of my life."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1831
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_bb78a173:

    # mc "Yo creo que lo podemos repetir, pero aún no ha acabado."
    mc "I think we can repeat it, but it's not over yet."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1833
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_1a8cb8cd:

    # kim "¿Qué quieres hacer ahora?"
    kim "What do you want to do now?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1834
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_4734d9f3:

    # mc "Yo me quedaría así un rato. Las vistas de esos ojos son increíbles."
    mc "I'd like to stay like this for a while. The view of those eyes is incredible."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1835
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_979338d3:

    # mc "Y suele ser el momento de las conversaciones trascendentales de después de comer. *Risa*"
    mc "And this is usually the time for transcendental post-lunch conversations. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1837
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0cad5588:

    # kim "Me gusta la parte de quedarnos así, pero no creo que sea una persona muy dada a conversaciones trascendentales. *Risa* Soy modelo."
    kim "I like the part about staying like this, but I don't think I'm someone who goes in for transcendental conversations. *Laugh* I'm a model."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1838
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_65eb5909:

    # mc "*Risa* Podemos estar así en silencio, entonces."
    mc "*Laugh* We can just stay silent like this, then."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1841
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d798c77f:

    # "El silencio dura menos de un minuto."
    "The silence lasts less than a minute."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1842
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_dc9b912a:

    # kim "Me alegra mucho que hayas arreglado las cosas con [kat]."
    kim "I'm really glad you sorted things out with [kat]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1843
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_3e225a4f:

    # mc "A mí también. La situación se estaba volviendo incómoda."
    mc "Me too. The situation was getting awkward."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1845
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_3479484c:

    # kim "Anoche volvía a ser ella misma por primera vez en días."
    kim "Last night, she was back to her old self for the first time in days."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1847
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d0365222:

    # mc "Su situación era complicada. Estaba viendo cosas donde no las había, tanto por su parte como por la mía."
    mc "Her situation was complicated. She was seeing things that weren't there, both on her part and mine."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1848
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_8762efa4:

    # mc "Me alegra haber aclarado las cosas con ella. Ahora podemos volver a ser amigos."
    mc "I'm glad I cleared things up with her. Now we can go back to being friends."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1849
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d151b96f:

    # mc "Pero no hablemos de [kat] en nuestra primera comida juntos."
    mc "But let's not talk about [kat] during our first meal together."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1851
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_a0b5ecd3:

    # mc "Su situación era complicada. Me alegro de que se haya resuelto."
    mc "Her situation was complicated. I'm glad it's resolved."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1853
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_db5e618b:

    # kim "La tenías que haber visto anoche. Estaba emocionada. *Risa* Pero fuiste un poco capullo."
    kim "You should have seen her last night. She was thrilled. *Laugh* But you were a bit of a jerk."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1854
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0a75022a:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Qué hice?"
    mc "Why? What did I do?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1856
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0ad182f4:

    # kim "*Risa* Cuando le dijiste que sentías que el universo del que hablaba no fuera el nuestro..."
    kim "*Laugh* When you told her you were sorry that the universe she was talking about wasn't ours..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1857
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_581f5c49:

    # kim "Por lo que me dijo, le dieron ganas de meter la cabeza dentro del agua y no volver a salir."
    kim "From what she told me, she felt like sticking her head underwater and never coming back up."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1858
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_49cd90be:

    # mc "*Risa* Menos mal que no lo hizo."
    mc "*Laugh* Good thing she didn't."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1859
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_1a539426:

    # mc "Pero me alegra que esté tan emocionada como yo."
    mc "But I'm glad she's as excited as I am."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1861
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_c26ff61d:

    # kim "Creo que lo está aún más. Ayer no hacía más que preguntarme cosas..."
    kim "I think she's even more excited. Yesterday she kept asking me things..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1862
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b225d9fa:

    # mc "¿Sobre lo que hicimos tú y yo antes de que yo bajara a la piscina?"
    mc "About what you and I did before I went down to the pool?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1864
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b5583109:

    # kim "Sobre eso también, pero no le di detalles. Lo que pasó en esa habitación es nuestro. Tuyo y mío."
    kim "About that too, but I didn't give her details. What happened in that room is ours. Yours and mine."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1865
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_bdc8f0c4:

    # kim "Quizás algún día hable de ello, pero, de momento, prefiero guardármelo para mí."
    kim "Maybe someday I'll talk about it, but for now, I prefer to keep it to myself."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1866
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_f310a217:

    # mc "Suena lógico. Pero entonces, ¿qué te preguntaba?"
    mc "That makes sense. But then, what was she asking you about?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1868
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_88e693d3:

    # kim "Un montón de cosas."
    kim "A bunch of things."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1869
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_75f93fd4:

    # kim "Si podía besarte cuando quisiera delante de otras chicas o de [mar]..."
    kim "If she could kiss you whenever she wanted in front of the other girls or [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1870
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6e12326f:

    # kim "Si tenía que ir maquillada y bien vestida siempre o podía segur llevando su ropa..."
    kim "If she always had to wear makeup and dress nicely or if she could keep wearing her own clothes..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1872
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_33f1d64e:

    # kim "Si tenía que comportarse de una forma distinta conmigo..."
    kim "If she had to behave differently around me..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1874
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_751db79c:

    # kim "Si tenía que comportarse de una forma distinta con las chicas del harén..."
    kim "If she had to behave differently around the girls in the harem..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1875
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_75affc1e:

    # mc "No lo entiendo. No soy la primera persona con la que sale."
    mc "I don't get it. I'm not the first person she's dated."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1877
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b3bd934d:

    # kim "Pero eres la primera persona con la que sale y con la que vive."
    kim "But you are the first person she's dating and living with."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1878
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_7644cc2b:

    # kim "No es lo mismo cuando solo ves a tu pareja cuando quedas con ella que si te la puedes encontrar recién levantada y aún sin peinar."
    kim "It's not the same when you only see your partner when you meet up with them, as opposed to running into them right after you wake up, still without your hair done."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1879
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_61b3af13:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿No te peinas nada más levantarte?"
    mc "*Laugh* Don't you brush your hair as soon as you wake up?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1881
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_94403679:

    # kim "*Risa* Me peino después de ducharme. Y nos podemos cruzar mientras voy de mi habitación a la ducha."
    kim "*Laugh* I comb my hair after showering. And we might cross paths while I go from my room to the shower."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1882
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_ca218cf1:

    # kim "A mí no me preocupa demasiado, igual que no me importa que me veas sin maquillar, pero era una de las preguntas que me hizo [kat]."
    kim "It doesn't worry me too much, just like I don't mind you seeing me without makeup, but it was one of the questions [kat] asked me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1883
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_a5e28ff0:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo a veces bajo a desayunar sin peinarme."
    mc "*Laugh* I sometimes go down for breakfast without brushing my hair."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1884
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_5c0a4d2c:

    # mc "Pero estamos hablando mucho de [kat] y poco de nosotros."
    mc "But we're talking a lot about [kat] and very little about us."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1885
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_6d33c123:

    # mc "Nunca me has explicado por qué una modelo estudia Económicas."
    mc "You never explained to me why a model studies Economics."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1887
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_c7510bd8:

    # kim "*Risa* Para tener un trabajo fiable cuando me rompa los dos tobillos desfilando."
    kim "*Laugh* To have a reliable job when I break both my ankles while modeling."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1888
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_57c7068f:

    # kim "*Risa* A veces da miedo subirse a una pasarela y ver la hostia que me podría dar."
    kim "*Laugh* Sometimes it's scary getting up on a runway and seeing the massive fall I could take."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1889
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_908c9784:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso demuestra lo valiente que eres. Desfilar sin armadura, conociéndote..."
    mc "*Laugh* That shows how brave you are. Modeling without armor, knowing you..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1890
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_4e3a13f1:

    # mc "Pero hablando en serio, ¿por qué Económicas?"
    mc "But seriously, why Economics?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1892
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_93cfa8db:

    # kim "Es fácil de explicar. Sé que la carrera de modelo no suele ser larga a menos que llegues a la cima."
    kim "It's easy to explain. I know that a modeling career is usually not long unless you reach the top."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1893
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_bc3716e3:

    # kim "Nunca he pensado que podría ser como Klaudia Schiffer o Noemi Campbell, con lo que lo más probable es que a los 30 no me contrate nadie ya."
    kim "I never thought I could be like Klaudia Schiffer or Noemi Campbell, so the most likely thing is that, by 30, no one will hire me anymore."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1894
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_e9584cf3:

    # mc "Eso no tiene por qué ser así."
    mc "That doesn't necessarily have to be the case."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1896
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_807e41f6:

    # kim "No tiene por qué serlo, pero es mejor estar preparada por si lo es."
    kim "It doesn't have to be, but it's better to be prepared just in case it is."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1897
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_e8d9411e:

    # kim "Si tengo que dejar de desfilar, lo que me gustaría sería ayudar a otras chicas que empiezan."
    kim "If I have to stop modeling, what I would like to do is to help other girls who are starting out."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1898
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_415a28c6:

    # kim "Y la mejor forma sería tener una agencia de modelos."
    kim "And the best way would be to have a modeling agency."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1899
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_97f8e04d:

    # mc "Es una buena idea. Pero ¿por qué Económicas y no Administración de Empresas o algo más relacionado con la moda?"
    mc "That's a good idea. But why Economics and not Business Administration or something more related to fashion?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1901
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_84c74b43:

    # kim "*Risa* Porque mi orientador en el instituto se equivocó o me malinterpretó cuando le expliqué lo que quería hacer."
    kim "*Laugh* Because my high school counselor made a mistake or misinterpreted me when I explained what I wanted to do."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1902
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_3e74629e:

    # kim "A mí me parecía raro que me recomendara Económicas, pero como nunca me ha gustado llevar la contraria a las personas que saben de lo que hablan..."
    kim "It seemed strange to me that he recommended Economics, but since I've never liked contradicting people who know what they're talking about..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1903
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_51e5134e:

    # mc "Pensaste que había algo que se te escapaba, ¿no?"
    mc "You thought there was something you were missing, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1905
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_8edee16d:

    # kim "Exacto. Y ahora estoy haciendo una carrera que... no es que no me guste, pero no le veo utilidad."
    kim "Exactly. And now I'm doing a degree that... it's not that I don't like it, but I don't see the utility in it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1906
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_d4e3695e:

    # kim "Seguramente acabaré con dos carreras o dejando ésta y aprovechando todo lo que pueda convalidar para pasarme a Administración de Empresas."
    kim "I'll probably end up with two degrees or drop this one and take advantage of everything I can transfer to switch to Business Administration."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1907
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_18c880f4:

    # kim "Si algún día tengo una empresa, necesitaré dominar cosas que no me enseñan en esta carrera."
    kim "If I ever have a company, I'll need to master things they don't teach me in this degree."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1908
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_4105365b:

    # mc "Creo que no es necesario. [nor] y yo estudiamos Administración de Empresas."
    mc "I don't think that's necessary. [nor] and I studied Business Administration."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1909
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_a565ca76:

    # mc "No hace falta que sepas hacer todo lo referido a una empresa. Puedes dejarte ayudar si algún día lo necesitas."
    mc "You don't need to know how to do everything related to a company. You can let others help you if you ever need it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1911
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_63b9e2a2:

    # kim "Creo que tú vas a estar muy ocupado, y a [nor] ya le damos demasiado trabajo."
    kim "I think you're going to be very busy, and we already give [nor] too much work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1912
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_b6b07f67:

    # mc "A menos que quieras tener una agencia de modelos enorme, creo que podríamos hacerlo."
    mc "Unless you want to have a huge modeling agency, I think we could handle it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1913
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0e8fb5cd:

    # mc "Y si tienes una agencia de modelos enorme, te dedicarás a otras cosas y tendrás un profesional para llevar la administración."
    mc "And if you have a huge modeling agency, you'll spend your time on other things, and hire a professional to handle the administration."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1915
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_31633934:

    # kim "Tienes razón. Como pensaba en algo pequeño... ya te he dicho que sería para ayudar a las chicas que empiezan... Creía que lo tendría que hacer todo yo, pero..."
    kim "You're right. Since I was thinking of something small... I already told you it would be to help girls who are starting out... I thought I would have to do everything myself, but..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1916
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_0ba53983:

    # mc "Pero ahora tienes una familia a tu alrededor en la que te puedes apoyar. Podemos ayudarte de cien formas diferentes."
    mc "But now you have a family around you that you can lean on. We can help you in a hundred different ways."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1917
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_7469a82d:

    # mc "Y no lo digo sólo porque estemos saliendo juntos. Si no lo hiciéramos también te lo propondría."
    mc "And I'm not just saying that because we're dating. I would offer it even if we weren't."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1919
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_9d2acfaf:

    # kim "Esa es una de las cosas con las que me empecé a enamorar de ti."
    kim "That's one of the things that made me start falling in love with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1920
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_4cf2e0a4:

    # kim "Siempre estás pensando en cómo ayudar a los demás sin pensar en la carga de trabajo que eso te va a reportar."
    kim "You're always thinking about how to help others without considering the workload it will bring you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1921
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_1c02ec21:

    # mc "No soy Elon Must. No pienso vivir para trabajar; prefiero trabajar para vivir."
    mc "I'm not Elon Must. I don't plan to live to work; I prefer to work to live."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1922
translate english c29s003_KimPicnic_e8ed5ada:

    # mc "Siempre tendré tiempo para ayudar a las personas que me importan."
    mc "I will always have time to help the people who matter to me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1929
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1930
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_d184ed08:

    # mc "Es Tía [bet]. Tengo que cogerlo."
    mc "It's Aunt [bet]. I have to answer."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1931
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_cf0589c2:

    # kim "No te preocupes. Dale un beso de mi parte. Yo voy a ir recogiendo esto mientras tanto."
    kim "Don't worry. Give her a kiss from me. I'll start packing this up in the meantime."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1935
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_3a23c045:

    # "Después de ver varios capítulos de una serie que hacía mucho que no veías..."
    "After watching several episodes of a series you hadn't seen in a long time..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1936
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_7dda0259_1:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1938
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_4fc57f2f:

    # mc "Buenas tardes, Tía [bet] y Meemaw."
    mc "Good afternoon, Aunt [bet] and Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1939
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_0f2c3c98:

    # bet "Hola, [mc]."
    bet "Hello, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1940
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_a45814fd:

    # mee "¿Cómo estás, [mc]?"
    mee "How are you, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1942
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_7e0d777b:

    # mc "Yo estoy bien. Estoy con [kim] en el campus haciendo un pícnic. Os envía besos. ¿Y vosotras?"
    mc "I'm doing well. I'm with [kim] on the campus having a picnic. She sends you kisses. And how are you two?"


# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1944
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_d7a3022f:

    # bet "¿Os estamos interrumpiendo una cita? No lo ha puesto en el grupo de Whatsup..."
    bet "Are we interrupting a date? She didn't post it in the WhatsUp group..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1945
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_a782e4a0:

    # mee "Ya llamaremos más tarde. No es urgente."
    mee "We'll call later. It's not urgent."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1946
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_c4d179a1:

    # mc "No os preocupéis. [kim] ha ido a tirar la basura a los contenedores de reciclaje mientras hablo con vosotras."
    mc "Don't worry. [kim] went to throw the trash in the recycling bins while I talk to you two."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1947
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_935ec1c0:

    # mc "¿Cómo estáis? ¿Qué tal la venta de la casa?"
    mc "How are you? How is the house sale going?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1949
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_79611646:

    # mc "Yo estoy bien. Me iba a poner a trabajar ahora. ¿Y vosotras? ¿Qué tal la venta de la casa?"
    mc "I'm fine. I was about to start working now. How about you two? How is the house sale going?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1950
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_f97bd0f7:

    # bet "Os dejo que habléis de la casa. Ahora vuelvo."
    bet "I'll let you talk about the house. I'll be right back."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1952
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_4fe34119:

    # mee "Muy bien, el chico del que te hablé ha estado aquí esta mañana y cree que se venderá bien."
    mee "Very well, the guy I told you about was here this morning and thinks it will sell well."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1953
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_27ca7fdb:

    # mee "Además, nos ha ahorrado un montón de trabajo."
    mee "Plus, he saved us a ton of work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1954
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_d953e167:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Qué ha pasado?"
    mc "Why? What happened?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1956
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_8d8279c7:

    # mee "Una casa se vende mejor si está decorada... Bueno, si está decorada con un mínimo gusto. Al menos para un cierto tipo de clientes."
    mee "A house sells better if it's decorated... Well, if it's decorated with minimal taste. At least for a certain type of client."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1957
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_61b5d4fb:

    # mee "Los compradores pueden ver cómo quedan los espacios de la casa y hacerse una idea de cómo les quedaría con sus muebles."
    mee "Buyers can see how the spaces in the house look and get an idea of how it would look with their furniture."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1958
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_3cfa67ca:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Es difícil hacerse una buena idea del tamaño de una habitación vacía."
    mc "I understand. It's hard to get a good idea of the size of an empty room."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1960
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_6388142c:

    # mee "Exacto. Este chico es muy profesional y, cuando se lo he comentado, me ha ofrecido un servicio de mudanza después de la venta."
    mee "Exactly. This guy is very professional, and when I mentioned it to him, he offered me a moving service after the sale."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1961
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_5ca1eba2:

    # mee "Con lo que sólo tendremos que empaquetar ropa y otros objetos personales. Pero no hará falta desmontar toda la casa."
    mee "Meaning we'll only have to pack clothes and other personal items. But we won't need to dismantle the whole house."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1962
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_f9385ed1:

    # mc "Eso es genial. ¿Significa que volveréis antes de lo pensado?"
    mc "That's great. Does that mean you'll be back sooner than expected?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1964
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_a3b6a4e7:

    # mee "Sí. En un par de horas vendrá el chico con el contrato."
    mee "Yes. The guy will be here with the contract in a couple of hours."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1965
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_ba904868:

    # mee "El lunes vendrán los de la mudanza para etiquetar las cosas que se tienen que llevar a Newport y a llevarse lo que empaquetemos este fin de semana."
    mee "On Monday, the movers will come to label the things that need to be taken to Newport and to take what we pack this weekend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1966
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_58861b56:

    # mee "El martes volaremos de vuelta a San Luis por la mañana."
    mee "On Tuesday morning, we'll fly back to San Luis."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1967
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_35c7a97d:

    # mc "¡Estupendo! Eso significa que os veré antes de irme a Aruba."
    mc "Wonderful! That means I'll see you before I leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1969
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_2ded94f2:

    # mee "Sí, [bet] quería hablar contigo sobre eso, a ver si vuelve."
    mee "Yes, [bet] wanted to talk to you about that, let's see if she comes back."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1970
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_a60259ed:

    # bet "*Fuera de cámara* Ya estoy aquí."
    bet "*Off-camera* I'm here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1971
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_311be437:

    # mc "¿De qué querías hablar, Tía [bet]?"
    mc "What did you want to talk about, Aunt [bet]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1974
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_49069ee2:

    # bet "*Risa* De cualquier cosa que no tenga que ver con vender la casa."
    bet "*Laugh* Anything that doesn't have to do with selling the house."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1975
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_c516d295:

    # mc "Supongo que es el tema favorito de Meemaw ahora mismo. Deformación profesional y esas cosas. Seguro que ha criticado cómo ha llevado el tema el chico ese."
    mc "I guess that's Meemaw's favorite topic right now. Professional deformation and all that. I bet she criticized how that guy handled the issue."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1976
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_20c1a642:

    # mee "*Fuera de cámara* *Risa* Os estoy escuchando..."
    mee "*Off-camera* *Laugh* I can hear you..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1977
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_1a41291d:

    # bet "*Risa* Creo que la conoces demasiado bien. Ella hubiera hecho un montón de cosas diferentes de lo que ha hecho el agente inmobiliario."
    bet "*Laugh* I think you know her too well. She would have done a lot of things differently than what the real estate agent did."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1978
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_bf616982:

    # mc "Se ha pasado muchos años vendiendo casas. Sabe de lo que habla."
    mc "She spent many years selling houses. She knows what she's talking about."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1980
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_f05d04ba:

    # bet "La verdad es que el chico ha sido muy amable y paciente. Yo no lo hubiera sido tanto si alguien me estuviera diciendo cómo tengo que hacer mi trabajo."
    bet "The truth is, the guy has been very kind and patient. I wouldn't have been so patient if someone were telling me how to do my job."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1981
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_6ae0f1a6:

    # mee "*Fuera de cámara* ¡Es que había cosas que él no estaba teniendo en cuenta!"
    mee "*Off-camera* He just wasn't taking some things into account!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1982
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_2711dc53:

    # bet "¿Ves? A eso me refiero. Aceptar consejos está bien. Que tu cliente te diga cómo se tienen que hacer las cosas es diferente."
    bet "See? That's what I mean. Accepting advice is fine. Having your client tell you how things need to be done is different."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1983
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_1dba9e68:

    # mc "*Risa* Me puedo imaginar la cara del vendedor cuando pensaba que iba a vender la casa de dos dulces ancianitas y se encuentra una fiera del mercado inmobiliario."
    mc "*Laugh* I can imagine the seller's face when he thought he was going to sell the house of two sweet old ladies and instead found a real estate market beast."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1985
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_a7dca11f:

    # bet "*Risa* Mas o menos ha sido eso. Por suerte mis clientes suelen estar anestesiados."
    bet "*Laugh* That's pretty much what happened. Luckily, my clients are usually anesthetized."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1986
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_d5d5fc42:

    # mc "*Risa* No me imagino a uno de tus clientes diciendo 'opere un poco más a la izquierda'."
    mc "*Laugh* I can't imagine one of your clients saying 'operate a little more to the left'."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1987
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_e8053039:

    # mc "*Risa* Y por suerte no eres forense. Si te lo dijeran entonces sería para salir corriendo."
    mc "*Laugh* And luckily you're not a forensic pathologist. If they told you that, then it would be time to run."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1989
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_8d7b5009:

    # bet "Pero de lo que realmente quería hablar contigo es que ya he escrito a Aaron para decirle que iré a Aruba a intentar hacer la operación."
    bet "But what I really wanted to talk to you about is that I've already written to Aaron to tell him I'm going to Aruba to try and perform the surgery."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1990
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_ae4da733:

    # mc "Eso es genial, Tía [bet]."
    mc "That's great, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1991
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_6644e336:

    # bet "¿Puedes decirle a [ama] que se ocupe de mis billetes de avión? La he llamado hace un rato, pero no la he localizado."
    bet "Can you tell [ama] to take care of my plane tickets? I called her a while ago, but I couldn't reach her."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1992
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_e006e001:

    # mc "Creo que no será necesario. Aunque [lis] se queje, pero creo que volaremos en uno de los aviones de la compañía."
    mc "I don't think that will be necessary. Even if [lis] complains, I think we'll fly on one of the company's planes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1994
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_3666c65d:

    # bet "¡Oh! No había pensado en eso. Me tengo que acostumbrar a que mi sobrino nieto es el CEO de una compañía importante con aviones privados."
    bet "Oh! I hadn't thought about that. I have to get used to the fact that my great-nephew is the CEO of a major company with private planes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:1995
translate english c29s004_BetMeeCall_f78e1345:

