    # mc "¿Y tú, [kia]?"
    mc "What about you, [kia]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2151
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_21aabace:

    # kia "Pienso lo mismo que [sim]. Debería ser con alguien con quien tuviera complicidad y, obviamente, mi hija también está descartada."
    kia "I think the same as [sim]. It should be with someone I have chemistry with, and obviously, my daughter is also ruled out."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2152
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_d529db79:

    # kia "Es más, creo que descartaría a cualquier mujer por debajo de 40 años. *Risita*"
    kia "What's more, I think I'd rule out any woman under 40. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2153
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_41dcdaa3:

    # mc "¿Por qué? Yo creo que la edad no tiene nada que ver con eso..."
    mc "Why? I don't think age has anything to do with that..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2155
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_d1a54d83:

    # sim "*Risa* Cree que no podría seguir el ritmo de una jovencita."
    sim "*Laugh* She thinks she couldn't keep up with a young girl."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2157
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_422b2f6a:

    # kia "*Risa* Yo no he dicho eso, pero es posible que lo de seguir el ritmo tenga algo que ver..."
    kia "*Laugh* I didn't say that, but it's possible that keeping up has something to do with it..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2158
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_29db807c:

    # mc "El sexo en grupo no tiene por qué ser un sprint. Creo que es más una maratón en la que la edad y la experiencia pueden ser beneficiosas."
    mc "Group sex doesn't have to be a sprint. I think it's more of a marathon where age and experience can be beneficial."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2160
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_a2bf947d:

    # kia "Bueno, sea como sea, en un hipotético caso donde pudiera elegir a cualquier mujer del mundo para hacer un trío..."
    kia "Well, be that as it may, in a hypothetical case where I could choose any woman in the world to have a threesome..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2161
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_8c98ebdf:

    # kia "Creo que mis candidatas serían [mar], [nor], y [sam], por ese orden."
    kia "I think my candidates would be [mar], [nor], and [sam], in that order."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2171
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_9fbb82b8:

    # mc "Sólo tenéis que hablarlo y ver si alguna de ellas está dispuesta... Y avisarme, claro"
    mc "You just have to talk to them about it and see if any of them are willing... And let me know, of course."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2173
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_4f00cc1f:

    # mc "Sólo tenéis que hablarlo y ver si alguna de las que están conmigo está dispuesta... Y avisarme, claro"
    mc "You just have to talk to them about it and see if any of the ones who are with me are willing... And let me know, of course."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2175
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_e8481afa:

    # mc "Sólo tenéis que hablarlo y ver si la que forma parte del harén está dispuesta... Y avisarme, claro"
    mc "You just have to talk to them about it and see if the one who is part of the harem is willing... And let me know, of course."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2177
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_ee33ec3f:

    # mc "Como ninguna está conmigo, creo que se quedará en un caso hipotético."
    mc "Since none of them are with me, I think it will remain a hypothetical case."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2180
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_37aa6df3:

    # mc "*Risa* No te las pienso prestar, con lo que creo que se quedará en un caso hipotético."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not going to lend them to you, so I think it will remain a hypothetical case."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2182
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_73918095:

    # mc "*Risa* No te pienso prestar a las que están en el harén, y no sé si la otra..."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not going to lend you the ones in the harem, and I don't know about the other one..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2184
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_7ba55b58:

    # mc "*Risa* No te pienso prestar a la que está conmigo, y no sé si las otras..."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not going to lend you the one who is with me, and I don't know about the others..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2186
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_ca4c8e1e:

    # mc "Las tres están libres, con lo que si encontráis un candidato masculino..."
    mc "The three of them are free, so if you find a male candidate..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2188
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_b764b005:

    # kia "*Risa* Ya he dicho que era un caso hipotético, no algo que fuera a pasar."
    kia "*Laugh* I already said it was a hypothetical case, not something that is going to happen."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2190
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_1bdab2be:

    # kia "*Risa* No empieces a hacer planes para llevarte a dos MILFs a la cama."
    kia "*Laugh* Don't start making plans to take two MILFs to bed."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2191
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_d4ecd937:

    # mc "*Risa* Todos sabemos que lo hipotético deja de serlo cuando se convierte en real."
    mc "*Laugh* We all know that the hypothetical stops being hypothetical when it becomes real."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2193
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_fe1e3988:

    # mc "¿Y tú, [sim]? ¿De verdad no tienes candidatas?"
    mc "What about you, [sim]? Do you really not have any candidates?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2196
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_12aeb12e:

    # sim "*Risa* Yo no descartaría a nadie por su edad. Y tampoco descartaría a nadie que estuviera en el harén."
    sim "*Laugh* I wouldn't rule anyone out because of their age. And I wouldn't rule out anyone who was in the harem either."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2198
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_ccbc0895:

    # sim "Excepto mi a madre, claro."
    sim "Except my mother, of course."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2199
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_e58c9fad:

    # sim "Quizás no hoy o mañana, pero dentro de un tiempo creo que tendremos la confianza suficiente entre todas nosotras para que sea una cosa muy bonita."
    sim "Maybe not today or tomorrow, but in some months or years, I think we'll have enough trust among all of us for it to be something really nice."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2201
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_ed635778:

    # sim "*Risa* Yo no descartaría a nadie por su edad. Pero las únicas con las que me lo plantearía son las chicas de la familia."
    sim "*Laugh* I wouldn't rule anyone out because of their age. But the only ones I would consider it with are the girls in the family."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2202
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_abd16c95:

    # sim "Y como no estás con ninguna, es algo que no se va a dar. No creo que funcionara para algo de una sola noche."
    sim "And since you aren't with any of them, it's not going to happen. I don't think it would work for a one-night thing."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2204
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_fad2bc89:

    # sim "Realmente no. *Risa* Creo que antes de plantearme algo así debería descubrir primero qué es lo que me gusta en el sexo."
    sim "Not really. *Laugh* I think before considering something like that, I should first discover what I like in sex."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2205
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_c7150440:

    # mc "Tiene sentido. El sexo en grupo puede servir para estrechar lazos, pero también puede no funcionar y estropear relaciones."
    mc "That makes sense. Group sex can serve to strengthen bonds, but it can also be a failure and ruin relationships."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2207
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_1b3a5312:

    # kia "¿Y tú? ¿Tienes pensado en alguien con quien tener sexo en grupo?"
    kia "What about you? Are you thinking about anyone to have group sex with?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2209
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_952f2c0b:

    # mc "No. Soy monógamo y creo que podría ser problemático meter a una mujer B en mi relación sólo para tener un trío."
    mc "No. I'm monogamous, and I think it could be problematic to bring Woman B, whoever she is, into my relationship just to have a threesome."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2211
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_4140441f:

    # mc "*Risa* Si ni siquiera tengo con quien tener sexo individual, menos aún con quien tener un trío. No he encontrado a la mujer A, menos aún a la B."
    mc "*Laugh* If I don't even have someone to have individual sex with, much less someone to have a threesome with. I haven't found Woman A, much less Woman B."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2213
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_1c8ecfd2:

    # mc "*Risa* Si sólo salgo con dos mujeres, no puede haber más candidatas. Meter a una mujer C sólo para un trío o un cuarteto sería problemático."
    mc "*Laugh* If I'm only dating two women, there can't be more candidates. Bringing in a Woman C just for a threesome or a foursome would be problematic."
# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2215
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_bed819b7:

    # mc "Estaría dispuesto a hacerlo con cualquier mujer del harén que lo proponga. Pero no voy a ser yo quién dé el primer paso."
    mc "I would be willing to do it with any woman in the harem who suggests it. But I'm not going to be the one to take the first step."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2216
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_d2d5190e:

    # mc "Podría crear suspicacias si intento tener un trío con A y con B dejando fuera a C."
    mc "It could create jealousy issues if I try to have a threesome with A and B while leaving C out."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2218
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_792b7910:

    # sim "*Risa* Me encanta que no hayas dicho nombres y que te hayas referido a las mujeres por letras. Nadie se puede dar por ofendida."
    sim "*Laugh* I love that you didn't say names and referred to the women by letters. No one can take offense."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2219
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_4dd49e4a:

    # mc "*Risa* No lo he dicho por eso, pero tienes razón. Creo que lo he hecho inconscientemente."
    mc "*Laugh* I didn't say it for that reason, but you're right. I think I did it unconsciously."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2220
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_be2ab672:

    # mc "Cambiando de tema, creo que ya he recibido mi máxima dosis de sol por un día. Me estoy empezando a tostar."
    mc "Changing the subject, I think I've already received my maximum dose of sun for one day. I'm starting to get burnt."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2222
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_7190b18a:

    # kia "Mira, por ahí viene [eri]. Por desgracia sin bikini..."
    kia "Look, [eri] is coming over there. Unfortunately, without a bikini..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2223
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_34e960c1:

