    kia "I think you're lucky, she seems to be looking for you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2225
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_7eee9ee7:

    # eri "Hola, chicas. ¿Puedo robaros a [mc] un momento?"
    eri "Hello, girls. Can I steal [mc] from you for a while?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2227
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_f1f90736:

    # sim "Por supuesto. Creo que se iba a ir ya. No aguanta el sol demasiado rato."
    sim "Of course. I think he was about to leave anyway. He can't handle the sun for too long."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2228
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_6ea05109:

    # kia "Se estaba empezando a quejar sobre eso cuando has aparecido."
    kia "He was starting to complain about that when you showed up."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2230
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_ba68e24d:

    # mc "¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Can I help you with something?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2231
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_02df623d:

    # eri "¿Sabes algo de electricidad? Hay un enchufe en mi habitación que no hace buen contacto y, antes de llamar a un electricista, quería preguntarte."
    eri "Do you know anything about electricity? There's a socket in my room that isn't working, and before calling an electrician, I wanted to ask you to look at it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2232
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_7c9eef15:

    # mc "No sé demasiado, pero puedo desmontar el enchufe y comprobarlo. ¿Déjame ir a por la caja de herramientas y te veo en tu habitación?"
    mc "I don't know too much, but I can disassemble the socket and check it. Let me go grab the toolbox, and I'll meet you in your room?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2234
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_caaf9976:

    # mc "Hasta luego, chicas. Una conversación interesante."
    mc "See you later, girls. That was an interesting conversation."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2235
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_ad5104bc:

    # sim "*Risa* Hasta luego, [mc]. Ve con cuidado con el enchufe."
    sim "*Laugh* See you later, [mc]. Be careful with the socket."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2236
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_e7478650:

    # kia "*Risa* No queremos tener que llevarte al hospital con los pelos de punta."
    kia "*Laugh* We don't want to have to take you to the hospital with your hair smoking."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2239
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_23baae4d:

