translate english c29s006_KiaSim_84b245a8:

    # mc "Nada demasiado importante. Sobre posibles combinaciones de sexo en grupo."
    mc "Nothing too important. About possible group sex combinations."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2242
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_041dbb7c:

    # eri "*Risa* Creo que eso puede ser MUY importante."
    eri "*Laugh* I think that can be VERY important."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2243
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_266791ee:

    # mc "*Risa* Cierto, podría serlo."
    mc "*Laugh* True, it could be."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2244
translate english c29s006_KiaSim_c39e7493:

    # mc "Espérame en tu habitación. Estaré ahí en dos minutos."
    mc "Wait for me in your room. I'll be there in two minutes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2248
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_8138957a:

    # eri "Este es el enchufe que no está funcionando bien. He probado a cambiar la bombilla y no es el problema."
    eri "This is the socket that isn't working properly. I tried changing the lightbulb, and that's not the problem."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2250
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_de08b597:

    # eri "También he probado a conectar la otra lámpara, que funciona bien en el otro enchufe, y no funciona en este."
    eri "I also tried connecting the other lamp, which works fine in the other socket, and it doesn't work in this one."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2251
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_719b4fd4:

    # mc "Déjame echarle una ojeada. Si es algo del enchufe, quizás pueda arreglarlo. Si el problema está en otro sitio..."
    mc "Let me take a look. If it's something inside the socket, maybe I can fix it. If the problem is somewhere else..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2253
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_a9634904:

    # eri "Habrá que llamar a un profesional, a menos que alguna de las chicas sepa algo de electricidad."
    eri "We'll have to call a professional, unless one of the girls knows something about electricity."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2254
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_c23ae037:

    # mc "Y, si nadie sabe nada, podemos traer a Jamaal para que meta los dedos en el enchufe e ir haciendo pruebas."
    mc "And, if nobody knows anything, we can bring Jamaal over to stick his fingers in the socket and start testing things."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2255
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_54937e72:

    # mc "*Risa* Cuando se le ponga el pelo tieso, significará que lo hemos arreglado."
    mc "*Laugh* When his hair stands up straight, it means we've fixed it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2257
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_961dfd27:

    # eri "*Risa* A veces no sé cómo te aguanta. Bueno, cómo os aguantáis mutuamente."
    eri "*Laugh* Sometimes I don't know how he puts up with you. Well, how you two put up with each other."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2258
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_f395001b:

    # mc "*Risa* Hasta ahora, te podía haber dicho que era porque soy su único amigo, pero estando con Anthony ya no me sirve esa excusa."
    mc "*Laugh* Until now, I could have told you it was because I was his only friend, but being with Anthony means that excuse doesn't work anymore."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2260
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_e5a6744e:

    # eri "¿Estás celoso? ¿Crees que vas a perder a tu amigo?"
    eri "Are you jealous? Do you think you're going to lose your friend?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2261
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_350b205e:

    # mc "Ni en broma. Me alegro mucho por Jam y Anthony parece un buen tío. Lo que me jode es no poder seguir usando esa explicación."
    mc "No way. I'm really happy for Jam, and Anthony seems like a good guy. What pisses me off is not being able to use that explanation anymore."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2262
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_7ea99201:

    # mc "¿Por qué no vas a cortar la electricidad? Quiero desmontar el enchufe, pero quiero sobrevivir a la experiencia."
    mc "Why don't you go turn off the power? I want to take the socket apart, but I want to survive the experience."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2264
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_a919c6ea:

    # eri "Voy abajo a cortar la luz y ahora subo."
    eri "I'm going downstairs to turn off the power, and I'll return in two minutes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2265
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_d54f149e:

    # mc "Mejor quédate abajo. Te mandaré un mensaje cuando haya acabado, para que la vuelvas a conectar."
    mc "Better if you stay downstairs. I'll send you a message when I'm done, so you can turn it back on."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2266
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_1f24c259:

    # mc "No quiero que nadie piense que ha habido un problema y conecte la luz cuando tenga los cables desconectados."
    mc "I don't want anyone to think there was a problem and connect the power while I have the wires disconnected."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2268
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_ec73b523:

    # eri "OK. Voy a avisar a todo el mundo de que vamos a cortar la luz. Avísame cuando acabes."
    eri "OK. I'm going to let everyone know we're cutting the power. Let me know when you're done."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2270
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_e5e83d73:

    # "Preparas la linterna que has traído para cuando [eri] corte la luz."
    "You prepare the flashlight and the tools you brought, to be ready for when [eri] cuts the power."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2271
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_f2d2f3fe:

    # mcp "(Espero acordarme de todo lo que me explicaron en el instituto sobre enchufes.)"
    mcp "(I hope I remember everything they explained to me in high school about sockets.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2273
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_41d397cb:

    # "Unos minutos después..."
    "A few minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2274
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_8d609d6b:

    # mcp "(Arreglado y continúo vivo. No era tan complicado. Veamos si ahora no se incendia la casa.)"
    mcp "(Fixed and I'm still alive. It wasn't that complicated. Let's see if the house doesn't burn down now.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2275
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_253dcc7f:

    # "Mandas un mensaje a [eri] para que conecte la luz."
    "You send a message to [eri] to turn on the power."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2277
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_3b6a2dd3:

    # mcp "(¡No sólo estoy vivo, sino que además funciona!)"
    mcp "(Not only am I alive, but it also works!)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2278
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_1cd804fe:

    # "Mandas otro mensaje a [eri] para decirle que el enchufe está arreglado. Te contesta que va a avisar a todo el mundo de que el problema está resuelto."
    "You send another message to [eri] to tell her the socket is fixed. She replies that she is going to notify everyone that the problem is solved."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2280
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_7d72f2ed:

    # "Decides esperar mientras examinas la habitación. Crees que no habías vuelto desde la irrupción de Eric, Gavin y el resto de los clones."
    "You decide to examine the room while you wait. You realize you hadn't been back since the intrusion of Eric, Gavin, and the rest of the clones."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2281
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_39872470:

    # "No tuviste tiempo de fijarte demasiado en la decoración aquel día."
    "You didn't have time to pay too much attention to the decor that day."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2282
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_fcfbc18c:

    # "Esos dos posters han estado ahí desde hace años, cuando [eri] empezó su fase gótica."
    "Those two posters have been there for years, since [eri] started her gothic phase."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2284
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_bf63b07b:

    # "La fotografía la recuerdas, pero los otros dos dibujos son nuevos."
    "You remember the photo, but the other two drawings are new."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2285
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_222ddce7:

    # "El de la chica gótica huyendo del corazón es tan [eri]... Especialmente en la época en que llevaba el pelo largo."
    "The one with the goth girl running away from the heart is so [eri]... Especially from the time when she had long hair."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2287
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_f86722b3:

    # mcp "(Por suerte ya no tiene que huir del amor...)"
    mcp "(Luckily, she no longer has to run away from love...)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2288
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_4782e1d9:

    # "Viéndolo todo en conjunto, te preguntas si los caballeros de la foto y el dibujo son, de alguna forma, una representación de ti."
    "Seeing them all together, you wonder if the knights in the photo and the drawing are, in some way, a representation of you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:2291
translate english c29s005_EriCommon_bc879cdc:

    # mcp "(¿Lo ha hecho [emm]? Sabía que tenía talento, pero no tanto.)"
    mcp "(Did [emm] do this? I knew she had talent, but not this much.)"

