    # mc "Pero tú no tienes tiempo para eso. Suficiente tienes con preparar toda la logística, aparte de estar vigilando la casa."
    mc "But you don't have time for that. You have enough on your plate preparing all the logistics, besides keeping watch over the house."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3761
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_4b1d62ea:

    # ama "Es lo que le he dicho, le estoy diciendo que, cuando [eva] me releve tendremos tiempo de hacerlo."
    ama "That's what I told her, I'm telling her that when [eva] relieves me, then we'll have time to do it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3763
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_3b7e67d3:

    # mc "Y a ti, ¿por qué no te parece bien esa idea?"
    mc "And you, why don't you like that idea?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3764
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_fc0c1cea:

    # emm "Por muchas razones. Acabo de encontrar a mi hermana perdida y ahora os vais a ir un mes entero. Yo quería pasar tiempo con ella..."
    emm "For many reasons. I just found my lost sister, and now you're going to leave for a whole month. I wanted to spend time with her..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3765
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_2f377eec:

    # mc "Creo que tiene más que ver con pasar tiempo con [ama] que con ayudar a la vigilancia."
    mc "I think it has more to do with spending time with [ama] than with helping with surveillance."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3766
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_2a80be31:

    # mc "Pero parece que habéis pasado tiempo juntas. Si las dos aún estáis en pijama, supongo que [ama] ha dormido aquí."
    mc "But it looks like you've spent time together. If you're both still in your pajamas, I guess [ama] slept here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3767
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_46e86052:

    # emm "Sí, pero no es suficiente... Tú te vas a pasar cinco o seis meses fuera, y ella se va a pasar uno allí y uno aquí, y después se volverá a ir."
    emm "Yes, but it's not enough... You're going to be away for five or six months, and she's going to spend one month there and one here, and then she'll leave again."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3768
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_c6743132:

    # mc "¿No crees que estás siendo un poco egoísta? [ama] tiene muchísimas cosas que hacer antes de irnos..."
    mc "Don't you think you're being a little selfish? [ama] has tons of things to do before we leave..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3770
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_9418d265:

    # emm "No es sólo por egoísmo. Si soy buena disparando, puedo ayudar a [eva] a hacer guardias mientras [ama] está fuera..."
    emm "It's not just selfishness. If I'm good at shooting, I can help [eva] stand guard while [ama] is away..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3771
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_b462deaa:

    # mc "Puedes ayudar a [eva] vigilando las cámaras en la base. No hace falta que dispares a nadie."
    mc "You can help [eva] by monitoring the cameras at the base. You don't need to shoot anyone."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3772
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_58e6b466:

    # mc "Además, ¿renunciarías a lo que te queda de verano por ayudar a [eva]?"
    mc "Besides, would you give up the rest of your summer to help [eva]?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3774
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_5213fed4:

    # emm "¡Por supuesto! ¡Ya no soy una niña pequeña! Una vez os vayáis, no va a haber mucho que hacer por aquí..."
    emm "Of course! I'm not a little kid anymore! Once you leave, there won't be much to do around here..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3775
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_858ec8fa:

    # mc "Es muy loable por tu parte, pero creo que te equivocas. Van a llegar las chicas nuevas, y tendrás que ayudar a Mamá y a Tía [nor] a prepararlo todo."
    mc "That's very commendable of you, but I think you're wrong. The new girls are arriving, and you'll have to help Mom and Aunt [nor] prepare everything."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3776
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_664707c8:

    # mc "Además, ¿quién mejor que mi hermanita para tener a todo el mundo vigilado dentro de la casa mientras [eva] vigila el perímetro?"
    mc "Besides, who better than my little sister to keep an eye on everyone inside the house while [eva] monitors the perimeter?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3778
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_38fab618:

    # ama "No lo había pensado, pero creo que [mc] tiene razón. Si ayudas a [mar] y a [nor] y ayudas a que las chicas nuevas se integren en casa..."
    ama "I hadn't thought about it, but I think [mc] is right. If you help [mar] and [nor], and help the new girls integrate into the house..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3780
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_9bbb6651:

    # emm "Querrás decir que se integren en la familia."
    emm "You mean integrate into the family."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3781
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_ce8fc48d:

    # mc "Creo que es pronto para eso. Aún no sabemos nada de ellas y no sabemos si serán buenas para la familia o si la familia será buena para ellas."
    mc "I think it's too soon for that. We still don't know anything about them and we don't know if they will be good for the family or if the family will be good for them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3783
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_ae54f02b:

    # ama "[mc] tiene razón. Por mucho que nos guste cómo está funcionando la familia, no quiere decir que todo el mundo pueda o quiera encajar en ella."
    ama "[mc] is right. As much as we like how the family is working, it doesn't mean everyone will want to or can fit into it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3784
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_efb615b2:

    # ama "[lis], [deb.nick], [kim], o [kat] han decidido que ésta es su segunda familia, pero porque llegaron cuando se estaba formando."
    ama "[lis], [deb.nick], [kim], or [kat] have decided that this is their second family, but that's because they arrived when it was forming."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3785
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_2cc6825c:

    # ama "Quizás para las chicas nuevas sea un poco abrumador. O quizás seamos bichos raros para ellas."
    ama "Maybe, it's a bit overwhelming for the new girls. Or maybe we're weirdos to them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3786
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_7d7ce691:

    # mc "Sólo hay que miraros a vosotras dos. Tendrán problemas para saber quién es el clon de quién."
    mc "You just have to look at the two of you. They'll have trouble figuring out who is whose clone."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3788
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_af4a8fa2:

    # emm "Lo estuve hablando ayer con [eva]. ¿Cómo se lo vamos a decir? Con las chicas de casa fue fácil, pero para las nuevas..."
    emm "I was talking about it yesterday with [eva]. How are we going to tell them? It was easy with the girls at home, but for the new ones..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3790
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_37e09f3b:

    # emm "Lo de 'Hola, soy [emm], a mi clon la conoceréis de aquí a dos semanas cuando vuelva de Aruba' no me parece una buena idea."
    emm "Saying 'Hi, I'm [emm], you'll meet my clone in two weeks, when she gets back from Aruba' doesn't seem like a good idea."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3792
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_825a2c44:

    # emm "Lo de 'Hola, soy [emm], a la chica de la que soy un clon la conoceréis de aquí a dos semanas cuando vuelva de Aruba' no me parece una buena idea."
    emm "Saying 'Hi, I'm [emm], you'll meet the girl I'm a clone of in two weeks, when she gets back from Aruba' doesn't seem like a good idea."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3793
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d3dd2ea2:

    # mc "*Risa* No, no parece una buena idea. Y no creo que esconder a [eva] hasta que sepamos más de ellas tampoco sea una buena idea. Ni que ella quisiera esconderse."
    mc "*Laugh* No, that doesn't sound like a good idea. And I don't think hiding [eva] until we know more about them is a good idea either. Not that she would want to hide."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3795
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_9368a549:

    # ama "*Risa* Por suerte, tú y yo estaremos en Aruba y no nos tendremos que comer ese problema. Se lo dejaremos a las que se queden aquí."
    ama "*Laugh* Luckily, you and I will be in Aruba and won't have to deal with that problem. We'll leave it to those who stay here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3796
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_4c745717:

    # ama "*Risa* Y que alguien intente esconder a [eva] si quiere morir."
    ama "*Laugh* And let someone try to hide [eva] if they want to die."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3797
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_67d495d5:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡No me puedo creer que vayamos a evitar comernos un problema!"
    mc "*Laugh* I can't believe we're going to avoid dealing with a problem!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3799
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_07700fa5:

    # ama "Creo que es algo que no se puede planificar hasta que estén aquí y vean de qué pasta están hechas."
    ama "I think it's something that can't be planned until they are here and we see what they are made of."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3800
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_fbd55643:

    # ama "Yo aceptaré cualquier cosa que decidáis las que estáis aquí sobre cómo y cuándo contárselo."
    ama "I will accept whatever you decide, those of you who are here, regarding how and when to tell them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3802
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_a5321266:

    # emm "Yo he pensado que..."
    emm "I was thinking that..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3803
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_27578b56:

    # mc "*Risa* Esa frase me da miedo en tus labios."
    mc "*Laugh* That sentence scares me coming from you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3804
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_28fc70c9:

    # emm "Voy a ignorar lo que ha dicho [mc]. Yo he pensado que no es necesario decírselo a todas a la vez."
    emm "I'm going to ignore what [mc] just said. I was thinking that it's not necessary to tell everyone at once."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3805
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_82eb43c8:

    # emm "Quizás ir explicándoselo a las que veamos con más probabilidades de aceptarlo."
    emm "Maybe we can explain it gradually to those we see as most likely to accept it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3806
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_9391f6b5:

    # mc "*Risa* Pues no daba tanto miedo..."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, that wasn't so scary..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3808
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d14ebbd9:

    # emm "*Risa* ¡Te estoy ignorando!"
    emm "*Laugh* I am ignoring you!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3809
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_c475d86f:

    # mc "Pero tienes razón. Creo que cuando conozcáis a cada una sabréis a quién se lo podéis decir en qué momento."
    mc "But you're right. I think when you get to know each one of them, you'll know who you can tell and when."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3810
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_3bed00b6:

    # mc "Es algo que iréis viendo vosotras en base a..."
    mc "It's something you'll figure out based on..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3813
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_b3412d60:

    # emm "Voy a contarle mi idea a Mamá. Os veo luego."
    emm "I'm going to tell Mom my idea. See you later."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3815
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_f9beaad8:

    # emm "¡Soy un genio! ¡Incluso [mc] ha reconocido que tengo razón!"
    emm "I'm a genius! Even [mc] admitted I was right!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3817
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_6e734612:

    # "*Blam*"
    "*Blam*"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3819
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_81cc233c:

    # ama "..."
    ama "..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3821
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_b3884595:

    # ama "*Risa* ¡Me encanta esta chica!"
    ama "*Laugh* I love that girl!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3822
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_c686dcf1:

    # mc "*Risa* No me extraña, dado que compartís material genético."
    mc "*Laugh* No wonder, given that you share genetic material."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3823
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_e27476b8:

    # mc "Siempre me he preguntado si entre clones sentís alguna afinidad o vínculo como los que se dice que tienen los gemelos."
    mc "I've always wondered if clones feel any affinity or bond between them, like the one twins are said to have."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3825
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_667bee92:

    # ama "No. No hay nada de eso. O al menos que [emm] o yo hayamos experimentado. Ella también se lo preguntaba y hablamos de ello hace unos días."
    ama "No. There's nothing like that. Or at least nothing [emm] or I have experienced. She was wondering about it too, and we talked about it a few days ago."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3826
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_456408b3:

    # ama "Pero claro, el vínculo de los gemelos tampoco está demostrado. Los hay que dicen tenerlo y los hay que no sienten nada."
    ama "But of course, the twin bond isn't proven either. Some say they have it, and others don't feel anything."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3828
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d6018cdd:

    # ama "[dap] y [eri] dicen que no tienen ningún vínculo sobrenatural, por ejemplo."
    ama "[dap] and [eri] say they don't have any supernatural bond, for example."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3829
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d04a3ca4:

    # mc "Lo sé. *Risa* [dap] pensaba que acabarían desarrollando telepatía o algo así cuando eran pequeñas."
    mc "I know. *Laugh* [dap] thought they would end up developing telepathy or something when they were little girls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3831
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_03f310e2:

    # ama "Hablando de clones..."
    ama "Speaking of clones..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3832
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_8a002195:

    # mc "¿Gavin?"
    mc "Gavin?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3833
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d116d3fc:

    # ama "Sí."
    ama "Yes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3834
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_8fe13dac:

    # mc "Supongo que [eva] te lo ha explicado. ¿Qué te parece?"
    mc "I guess [eva] explained it to you. What do you think?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3836
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_decd32cf:

    # ama "Creo que es una buena idea. Si todo sale bien, puede ser un activo valioso."
    ama "I think it's a good idea. If everything goes well, he can be a valuable asset."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3837
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_47a4b059:

    # ama "Si no sale como esperamos, podrá ayudarnos con la vigilancia."
    ama "If it doesn't go as we expect, he can help us with surveillance."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3838
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_dbda57d8:

    # mc "Y, sea como sea, [eva] se sentirá menos culpable y él se sentirá útil."
    mc "And, either way, [eva] will feel less guilty, and he will feel useful."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3840
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_446b2138:

    # ama "Y nos relevará a nosotras de mucho trabajo. Hacer toda la vigilancia entre las dos mientras intentamos llevar una vida 'normal' está siendo un reto."
    ama "And he'll relieve us of a lot of work. Doing all the surveillance between the two of us while trying to lead a 'normal' life is proving to be a challenge."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3841
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_07b6d5aa:

    # mc "Le he estado dando vueltas a eso también. Creo que sería bueno que, cuando volvieras después de la primera rotación, trajeras más clones aparte de Gavin."
    mc "I've been thinking about that too. I think it would be good if, when you return after the first rotation, you bring more clones besides Gavin."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3842
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_5f8ab4f8:

    # mc "De series diferentes, para que no se vea que son clones entre ellos."
    mc "But from different series, so it's not obvious they are clones of each other."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3844
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_1398bcc9:

    # ama "¿No quieres que sigamos protegiendo a la familia nosotras?"
    ama "You don't want us to continue protecting the family?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3845
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_7eeffbf8:

    # mc "Claro que sí. Puedes dirigir el equipo, pero creo que eres demasiado valiosa como para que te pases horas mirando cámaras de seguridad."
    mc "Of course I do. You can lead the team, but I think you are too valuable to spend hours looking at security cameras."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3846
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_1bd41600:

    # mc "Puedes hacer mucho más si delegas en Gavin y otros chicos el trabajo de nivel más bajo."
    mc "You can do much more if you delegate the lower-level work to Gavin and the other guys."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3847
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_e41b14ba:

    # mc "Después de la primera rotación estarás sola y tienes que dormir."
    mc "After the first rotation, you'll be alone, and you need to sleep."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3849
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_844fcb37:

    # ama "Llevo tantos meses haciendo esto que ya lo encuentro normal, pero tienes razón. Aunque no sabría en quién puedo delegar..."
    ama "I've been doing this for so many months that I find it normal now, but you're right. Although I wouldn't know who I can delegate to..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3850
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_ee9423d2:

    # mc "Bueno, vas a tener un mes en Aruba para poder descubrirlo y organizar un equipo. Incluso un par de equipos que puedan rotar entre aquí y allí."
    mc "Well, you're going to have a month in Aruba to figure it out and organize a team. Even a couple of teams that can rotate between here and there."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3851
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_08dec452:

    # mc "Vosotras habéis sido prácticamente esclavas de la misión, y el tiempo de la esclavitud en NTR ha acabado."
    mc "You have practically been slaves to the mission, and the time for slavery in NTR is over."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3853
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d7d4d644:

    # ama "*Risa* ¿Quieres decir que los que vengan trabajarán ocho horas? Se van a reblandecer."
    ama "*Laugh* Do you mean those who come will work eight hours? They're going to get soft."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3854
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_a1da7267:

    # mc "Estoy hablando en serio, [ama]. Quiero que los clones que decidan seguir trabajando para nosotros tengan una vida normal... o todo lo normal posible."
    mc "I'm serious, [ama]. I want the clones who decide to keep working for us to have a normal life... or as normal as possible."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3855
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_7d5b5772:

    # mc "Quiero que tengan tiempo libre, que puedan ir al cine o a cenar. Que puedan formar sus propias familias si encuentran con quién hacerlo."
    mc "I want them to have free time, to be able to go to the movies, or out to dinner. To be able to form their own families if they find someone to do it with."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3857
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_8769e4d7:

    # ama "Eso que dices es muy complicado. Sé que tu intención es buena, pero ¿quién va a querer formar una familia con un clon que envejece aceleradamente?"
    ama "What you're saying is very complicated. I know your intention is good, but who is going to want to start a family with a clone who ages quickly?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3859
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_db8abd2e:

    # mc "¿Crees que, si envejecieras aceleradamente, no estaría contigo?"
    mc "Do you think that, if you had the quick aging thing, I wouldn't be with you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3861
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_27e4a02d:

    # mc "¿Crees que, si [eva] envejeciera aceleradamente, no estaría con ella?"
    mc "Do you think that if [eva] had the quick aging thing, I wouldn't be with her?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3863
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_02bc2b25:

    # mc "¿Crees que, si me enamorara de alguien que envejece aceleradamente, eso me detendría?"
    mc "Do you think that if I fell in love with someone who aged quickly, that would stop me?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3864
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_ffbc9c15:

    # mc "Sería una buena razón para atesorar cada momento, porque serían aún más limitados."
    mc "It would be a good reason to treasure every moment, because they would be even more limited."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3866
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_0a088b0c:

    # ama "No, no lo creo. Pero no podría ser algo para toda la vida. Al menos no para toda tu vida..."
    ama "No, I don't think so. But it couldn't be something for life. At least not for your whole life..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3867
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_a3d8f643:

    # mc "Eso nunca se puede saber. A mí estuvieron a punto de matarme. A muchos de nosotros. Nunca sabes cuánto va a durar una vida."
    mc "You can never know that. Eric and his team were about to kill me. They tried to kill many of us. You never know how long a life is going to last."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3868
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_88691a59:

    # mc "Pero no te centres sólo en lo de formar una familia. Quiero que puedan vivir su vida, y para eso necesitarán tiempo libre."
    mc "But don't just focus on starting a family. I want them to be able to live their lives, and for that, they will need free time."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3869
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_8e92e5cb:

    # mc "Tendrías que hacer cálculos para saber cuántos operativos necesitarías para cubrir todas las necesidades y, una vez estemos allí, elegir a los candidatos."
    mc "You would have to make calculations to know how many operatives you would need to cover all the necessities and, once we are there, choose the candidates."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3871
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_168fe1be:

    # ama "Supongo que es el trabajo que me tocará hacer como jefa de seguridad, pero me cuesta mucho delegar en cosas que son importantes para mí."
    ama "I suppose that's the job I'll have to do as head of security, but it's very hard for me to delegate things that are important to me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3872
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_503b7ebb:

    # mc "¿Crees que no van a hacer un trabajo tan bueno como hacéis vosotras?"
    mc "Do you think they won't do as good a job as you two are doing?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3873
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_e9009f6f:

    # ama "No es eso. Sé que van a hacer un trabajo fantástico, incluso mejor que el nuestro porque van a poder cubrir más horas, pero..."
    ama "It's not that. I know they are going to do a fantastic job, even better than ours because they will be able to cover more hours, but..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3874
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d554d806:

    # mc "¿Pero...?"
    mc "But...?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3876
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_0f714d57:

    # ama "Me encanta ver a las chicas en la piscina cuando estoy vigilando en la base. O a [mar] cocinando. O a [nor] haciendo la colada."
    ama "I love watching the girls in the pool when I'm monitoring the cameras at the base. Or [mar] cooking. Or [nor] doing the laundry."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3877
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_453bf0c8:

    # ama "Entregar esa parte de la vida familiar va a ser duro... No quiero perdérmelo..."
    ama "Giving up that part of family life is going to be hard... I don't want to miss it..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3878
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_6671700b:

    # mc "Si entregas esa parte de la vida familiar, podrás estar en la piscina, o ayudando a [mar] y a [nor], en vez de estar en la base."
    mc "If you give up that part of family life, you can be at the pool, or helping [mar] and [nor], instead of being at the base."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3879
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_da635cfe:

    # mc "No lo tendrás que ver a través de una pantalla, sino que podrás vivirlo. Ser parte de esa vida familiar más aún de lo que lo eres ahora mismo."
    mc "You won't have to see it through a screen; you'll be able to live it. Be part of that family life even more than you are right now."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3881
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_2e85f522:

    # ama "¡Soy idiota! ¡Tienes razón!"
    ama "I'm an idiot! You're right!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3882
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_b764a24e:

    # mc "*Risa* Me voy a comprar una camiseta que ponga algo por el estilo. Nos ahorraríamos un montón de conversaciones."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm going to buy a T-shirt that says something like that. It would save us a lot of conversations."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3884
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_d58efabd:

    # ama "*Risa* Si llevaras una camiseta como esa, nadie de esta familia te daría nunca la razón. Ni siquiera cuando la tuvieras."
    ama "*Laugh* If you wore a T-shirt like that, no one in this family would ever agree with you. Not even when you were right."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3885
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_3e19a798:

    # mc "*Risa* Sólo por llevar la contraria, ¿no?"
    mc "*Laugh* Just to contradict me, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3887
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_8ab0a303:

    # ama "No voy a contestar a eso, porque sería como darte la razón."
    ama "I'm not going to answer that, because it would be like agreeing with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3888
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_89801f5f:

    # ama "Pero me voy a hacer unos cálculos para saber cuántos clones necesito para cubrir todos los turnos. Te veo luego."
    ama "But I'm going to run some calculations to find out how many clones I need to cover all the shifts. I'll see you later."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3890
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_0e42c222:

    # mc "Hasta luego..."
    mc "See you later..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3892
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_13c2270e:

    # mcp "(Tengo que dejar de darles ideas que quieran explorar inmediatamente. Las dos se han ido sin darme un beso.)"
    mcp "(I need to stop giving them ideas they want to explore immediately. They both left without giving me a kiss.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3894
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_8d6f4c56:

    # mcp "(Tengo que dejar de darle ideas que quiera explorar inmediatamente. Se ha ido sin darme un beso.)"
    mcp "(I have to stop giving her ideas she wants to explore immediately. She left without giving me a kiss.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3896
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_b75a84f6:

    # mcp "(Ha hecho lo mismo que [emm]. Tengo que dejar de darle ideas a [emm] que quiera explorar inmediatamente. Se ha ido sin darme un beso.)"
    mcp "(She did the same thing as [emm]. I have to stop giving [emm] ideas she wants to explore immediately. She left without giving me a kiss.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3898
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_edea11a0:

    # mcp "(Tengo que dejar de darle ideas que quiera explorar inmediatamente. Me he acabado quedando solo.)"
    mcp "(I have to stop giving her ideas she wants to explore immediately. I ended up staying alone.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3900
translate english c29s006_AmaEmm_0400d3a2:

    # "Decides que es el momento de desayunar."
    "You decide it's time for breakfast."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3904
translate english c29s006_DebEil_a38d722e:

    # "Al entrar en la cocina..."
    "Upon entering the kitchen..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3905
translate english c29s006_DebEil_afdc2189:

    # deb "¿Ves? Este es el vestido que te decía. Creo que te quedaría genial."
    deb "See? This is the dress I was telling you about. I think it would look great on you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3906
translate english c29s006_DebEil_2d104731:

    # eil "Me gusta mucho, pero es carísimo. Creo que compraré algo más sencillo."
    eil "I really like it, but it's super expensive. I think I'll buy something plainer."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3907
translate english c29s006_DebEil_ad02216d:

    # deb "Por eso no te preocupes. Tómatelo como mi regalo de cumpleaños."
    deb "Don't worry about that. Take it as my birthday gift."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3909
translate english c29s006_DebEil_25587b60:

    # eil "¡Pero mi cumpleaños fue en marzo!"
    eil "But my birthday was in March!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3910
translate english c29s006_DebEil_e708b9e9:

    # deb "*Risa* Entonces tómatelo como mi regalo de cumpleaños con MUCHO retraso."
    deb "*Laugh* Then take it as my VERY late birthday gift."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3911
translate english c29s006_DebEil_ba31e75d:

    # mc "Hola, chicas. ¿Comprando ropa por internet?"
    mc "Hello, girls. Shopping for clothes online?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3913
translate english c29s006_DebEil_f797514f:

    # eil "Hola, [mc]. No estamos comprando por internet. [mad.nick] le envió a [lis] un email con las novedades que han llegado."
    eil "Hi, [mc]. We're not shopping online. [mad.nick] sent [lis] an email with the catalogue of new arrivals."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3914
translate english c29s006_DebEil_b17bb53e:

    # mc "*Risa* A eso se le llama buen márquetin. Sabe que va a tener ventas aseguradas."
    mc "*Laugh* That's called good marketing. She knows she's going to have guaranteed sales."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3916
translate english c29s006_DebEil_32f2cf33:

    # deb "*Risa* Creo que [lis] va a dejar de comprar ropa una temporada o tendrá que alquilar un trastero para tener dónde guardarla."
    deb "*Laugh* I think [lis] is going to have to stop buying clothes for a while or she'll have to rent a storage unit to keep them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3917
translate english c29s006_DebEil_e3a53e8c:

    # deb "Ha comprado más ropa incluso de la que es normal en ella últimamente. Y yo también, con lo que no puede usar mi armario para guardar toda su ropa."
    deb "She's bought even more clothes than is normal for her, lately. And so have I, so she can't use my closet to store all her clothes anymore."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3918
translate english c29s006_DebEil_470feedd:

    # mc "Me dijo que estaba usando el de [bet]..."
    mc "She told me she was using [bet]'s..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3920
translate english c29s006_DebEil_8c87ff9c:

    # eil "Pero [bet] vuelve el martes y traerá ropa de Florida. Y en septiembre esos armarios serán para las chicas nuevas."
    eil "But [bet] comes back on Tuesday, and she'll bring clothes from Florida. And in September those closets will be for the new girls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3921
translate english c29s006_DebEil_24b4bc08:

    # eil "[lis] va a tener un problema para guardar toda la ropa."
    eil "[lis] is going to have a problem storing all her clothes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3922
translate english c29s006_DebEil_79eca546:

    # mc "De todas formas, se me hace extraño que tú compres vestidos caros. O que te los regale [deb.nick]."
    mc "Anyway, it seems strange to me that you're buying expensive dresses. Or that [deb.nick] is gifting them to you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3923
translate english c29s006_DebEil_4d9b8159:

    # mc "Siempre has sido más de ir cómoda que con vestidos así."
    mc "You've always been more about being comfort than wearing dresses like that."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3925
translate english c29s006_DebEil_1eeeef6f:

    # mc "Además, tienes un novio que te puede comprar la ropa que necesites..."
    mc "Besides, you have a boyfriend who can buy you the clothes you need..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3927
translate english c29s006_DebEil_6558dda5:

    # eil "Bueno, una chica tiene que tener algo elegante, ¿no?"
    eil "Well, a girl needs to have something elegant, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3928
translate english c29s006_DebEil_2f52e67f:

    # eil "Si surge la ocasión, no quiero tener que llevar el vestido con el que fui al baile de promoción."
    eil "If the occasion arises, I don't want to have to wear the dress I wore to prom."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3929
translate english c29s006_DebEil_5086f3ff:

    # mc "Estabas monísima con aquel vestido."
    mc "You looked adorable in that dress."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3931
translate english c29s006_DebEil_30c0b41a:

    # deb "La verdad es que estaba muy guapa. Tú, sin embargo..."
    deb "The truth is she looked very pretty. You, however..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3932
translate english c29s006_DebEil_a0948ada:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo parecía un tonel al que le hubieran puesto un smoking."
    mc "*Laugh* I looked like a barrel wearing a tuxedo. A tuxedo not even barrel-sized."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3934
translate english c29s006_DebEil_c46ab85e:

    # deb "*Risa* Yo no diría tanto, pero casi. Si ahora la ropa no te queda demasiado bien, por entonces era horrible."
    deb "*Laugh* I wouldn't say that much, but you're not too wrong. If clothes don't fit you well now, back then it was horrible."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3936
translate english c29s006_DebEil_f12fa16e:

    # mc "*Risa* Tener novia para esto..."
    mc "*Laugh* Having a girlfriend for this..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3937
translate english c29s006_DebEil_2d86cf5b:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Quién quiere enemigos teniendo amigos como tú?"
    mc "*Laugh* Who needs enemies when I have friends like you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3938
translate english c29s006_DebEil_4582dcc1:

    # deb "*Risa* ¡Hey! ¡Fuiste tú el que empezó esto de no mentir nunca!"
    deb "*Laugh* Hey! You were the one who started this whole 'never lie' thing!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3940
translate english c29s006_DebEil_17bb63e2:

    # eil "*Risa* [deb.nick] tiene razón. Tienes muchas cualidades, pero la elegancia nunca ha sido una de ellas."
    eil "*Laugh* [deb.nick] is right. You have many qualities, but elegance has never been one of them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3941
translate english c29s006_DebEil_6ca9f5b9:

    # eil "*Risa* Lo bueno de eso es que, te pongas lo que te pongas, te va a quedar igual de mal."
    eil "*Laugh* The good thing about that is, no matter what you wear, it's going to look equally bad on you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3942
translate english c29s006_DebEil_5d0fb859:

    # mc "*Risa* A veces os odio. Por suerte, lo tengo asumido y no le doy importancia."
    mc "*Laugh* Sometimes I hate you two. Luckily, I've accepted it and I don't care about clothing anymore."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3943
translate english c29s006_DebEil_90a9e97b:

    # mc "Aparte de meteros con mi falta de elegancia, ¿tenéis algún plan para hoy? ¿Queréis que hagamos algo?"
    mc "Aside from making fun of my lack of elegance, do you have any plans for today? Do you want us to do something?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3945
translate english c29s006_DebEil_c902ca09:

    # deb "Yo tengo que estudiar un montón. Tengo que acabar Villette, de Charlotte Brontë. Voy a estar ocupada todo el fin de semana."
    deb "I have a ton of studying to do. I have to finish Villette, by Charlotte Brontë. I'll be busy all weekend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3946
translate english c29s006_DebEil_58f24768:

    # mc "¡Uff! Eso suena tedioso."
    mc "Ugh! That sounds tedious."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3947
translate english c29s006_DebEil_d0b5d0bf:

    # deb "No es tan interesante como Jane Eyre, pero me está gustando bastante."
    deb "It's not as interesting as Jane Eyre, but I'm enjoying it quite a bit."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3949
translate english c29s006_DebEil_8916c25b:

    # mc "¿Y tú, [eil]? ¿Algún plan? ¿Trabajas hoy?"
    mc "What about you, [eil]? Any plans? Are you working today?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3950
translate english c29s006_DebEil_d89ebf5c:

    # eil "Sí, trabajo esta tarde después de comer. Por la mañana está [eri] en el café y la relevaré yo."
    eil "Yes, I work this afternoon after lunch. [eri] is at the café this morning and I'll relieve her."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3951
translate english c29s006_DebEil_9f3628e4:

    # mc "¿[sca] sigue emocionada con el trabajo?"
    mc "Is [sca] still excited about the job?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3953
translate english c29s006_DebEil_f85a1ffb:

    # eil "Emocionadísima. Aparte de un trabajo en una hamburguesería un par de semanas haciendo una sustitución, va a ser su primer trabajo de verdad."
    eil "Extremely excited. Aside from working at a burger place for a couple of weeks as a part-timer, this is going to be her first real job."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3954
translate english c29s006_DebEil_c62b7214:

    # eil "Ayer fue a firmar el contrato y a recoger los uniformes. Hoy se pasará la mañana con [eri] en el café. Quiere aprenderlo todo antes de empezar el lunes."
    eil "Yesterday, she went to sign the contract and pick up the uniforms. Today she'll spend the morning with [eri] at the café. She wants to learn everything before starting on Monday."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3955
translate english c29s006_DebEil_0349b1b0:

    # mc "¿Os deja trabajar tranquilas?"
    mc "Does she let you work in peace?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3957
translate english c29s006_DebEil_2c59b741:

    # eil "*Risa* Intenta no molestar con demasiadas preguntas, pero a veces no puede contenerse."
    eil "*Laugh* She tries not to bother us with too many questions, but sometimes she can't help herself."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3958
translate english c29s006_DebEil_00e79723:

    # mc "*Risa* Esa es nuestra [sca]. Cuando se emociona con algo no puede parar."
    mc "*Laugh* That's our [sca]. When she gets excited about something, she can't stop with the questions."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3959
translate english c29s006_DebEil_6c39a121:

    # eil "*Risa* Lo bueno es que el lunes no tendré casi nada que enseñarle."
    eil "*Laugh* The good thing is that, on Monday, I'll have almost nothing left to teach her."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3961
translate english c29s006_DebEil_cf214f40:

    # deb "Yo estaría al revés, acojonada por todo lo que puede salir mal en mi primer día de trabajo."
    deb "I would be the opposite, terrified of everything that could go wrong on my first day of work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3962
translate english c29s006_DebEil_7aeaa206:

    # deb "Estoy segura de que me aturdiría en el momento en que tuviera que preparar dos pedidos diferentes."
    deb "I'm sure I'd get flustered the moment I had to prepare two different orders. With all the customers looking at me..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3964
translate english c29s006_DebEil_4f6611cc:

    # eil "Y a ella le pasará lo mismo. Pero el lunes estaré yo con ella, y el martes estaremos tanto [eri] como yo. Y al menos sabe llevar una bandeja."
    eil "And the same thing will happen to her. But I'll be with her on Monday, and both [eri] and I will be there on Tuesday. And at least she knows how to carry a tray."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3965
translate english c29s006_DebEil_f8faa6da:

    # eil "Nadie le va a exigir que el primer día haga el mismo trabajo que hacemos las que llevamos meses ahí."
    eil "No one is going to demand that she does the same work on the first day that those of us who have been there for months do."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3966
translate english c29s006_DebEil_24d68fc0:

    # mc "Sería injusto en sus primeros días. Sólo espero que no os dé más trabajo del que os quita."
    mc "It would be unfair in her first few days. I just hope she doesn't give you more work than she saves you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3968
translate english c29s006_DebEil_629ee28c:

    # deb "Bueno, yo me tengo que ir a seguir leyendo. Os veo luego."
    deb "Well, I have to get back to reading. See you later."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3969
translate english c29s006_DebEil_c179d641:

    # eil "Yo también me voy a ir. Quiero hablar de unos temas con mi madre antes de que se vaya a la biblioteca."
    eil "I'm going to leave too. I want to discuss a few things with my mother before she goes to the library."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3970
translate english c29s006_DebEil_2fcb3ef6:

    # mc "Os veo luego, chicas. Yo voy a desayunar algo."
    mc "See you later, girls. I'm going to go grab some breakfast."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3972
translate english c29s006_DebEil_b415b3e5:

    # "Te quedas solo en la cocina y tomas un desayuno ligero. A estas horas sólo queda un dónut después de que todo el mundo haya desayunado."
    "They leave you alone in the kitchen, and you have a light breakfast. At this hour, only one donut is left after everyone else has had breakfast."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3974
translate english c29s006_DebEil_0f7466e4:

    # "Se te escapa una sonrisa al ver el tipo de dónut que te vas a comer."
    "A smile appears on your lips when you see the kind of donut you are about to eat."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3984
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_d8d99eeb:

    # "Mientras tanto, en un café al otro lado de Newport..."
    "Meanwhile, at a café on the other side of Newport..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3985
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_21252734:

    # eva "Espero que [nor] tenga razón y no sea para tanto."
    eva "I hope [nor] is right and it's not a big deal."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3987
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_ec4f0c75:

    # mad "Yo también. Me he pasado la noche pensando en ello."
    mad "Me too. I spent the whole night thinking about it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3989
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_3c1128e8:

    # mad "Yo también. Por suerte, no tengo que pasar por ello."
    mad "Me too. Luckily, I don't have to go through it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3990
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_c26db71f:

    # mad "¿Quién queda por venir?"
    mad "Who's left to come?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3992
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_64a74a37:

    # eva "Creo que sólo [dap] y [sca]. Vendrán mañana, cuando [sca] salga de trabajar."
    eva "I think only [dap] and [sca] are left. They'll come on Monday, when [sca] gets off work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3994
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_bfe8d490:

    # eva "Creo que sólo [dap]. Vendrá mañana, cuando [sca] salga de trabajar."
    eva "I think only [dap] is left. She'll come on Monday, when [sca] gets off work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3996
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_13ddcc41:

    # eva "Creo que sólo [sca]. Vendrá mañana, cuando salga de trabajar."
    eva "I think only [sca] is left. She'll come on Monday, when she gets off work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:3998
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_a4a2543b:

    # eva "Creo que no queda nadie más."
    eva "I don't think anyone else is left."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4000
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_475ffc28:

    # eva "[dap] se va a pasar la mañana en el café, dándole apoyo moral a [sca]."
    eva "[dap] is going to spend the morning at the café, giving [sca] moral support."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4001
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_8fd86471:

    # sai "No le demos más vueltas y cambiemos de tema. ¿Qué os parecen las chicas nuevas?"
    sai "Let's not dwell on it, and let's change the subject. What do you think of the new girls?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4003
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_00576b75:

    # eva "Tu prima es guapísima. Y el resto no se quedan atrás. Creo que la tal [zoe] me va a caer bien."
    eva "Your cousin is gorgeous. And the rest aren't far behind. I think I'm going to like [zoe]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4004
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_c739e0f8:

    # eva "Pero la tal [cri.nick] me da mala espina."
    eva "But that [cri.nick] girl gives me a bad feeling."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4006
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_485c5308:

    # mad "¿Por qué? [eri] dijo que [mc] había dicho lo mismo, pero supongo que no es por que vaya teñida."
    mad "Why? [eri] told me [mc] said the same thing, but I guess it's not because she dyes her hair."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4007
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_1d92ddc1:

    # mad "Parece casualidad que las dos asiáticas de la familia vayamos teñidas, ¿no? Y a mí no me juzgáis por eso."
    mad "It looks like a coincidence that the two Asian members of the family dye their hair, right? And you don't judge me for that."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4009
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_e3c7154d:

    # sai "*Risa* Me gusta que ya las consideres de la familia antes aún de que hayan llegado."
    sai "*Laugh* I like that you already consider them family before they've even arrived."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4011
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_9f3b7937:

    # mad "¡Oops! Ni me había dado cuenta de que lo había hecho. Pero... es normal, ¿no?"
    mad "Oops! I didn't even realize I did that. But... it's normal, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4012
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_dc4257e1:

    # mad "Lo hemos vivido con cada persona que se ha acercado a los Marks. Es lógico que les pase a las chicas nuevas también."
    mad "We've experienced it with every person who has gotten close to the Marks. It's logical that it happens to the new girls too."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4014
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_be2dceba:

    # eva "¿Cada persona? *Risa* Querrás decir cada chica."
    eva "Every person? *Laugh* You mean every girl."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4015
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_0c353a9b:

    # eva "Por norma los hombres salen mal parados cuando se acercan a los Marks."
    eva "As a rule, men fare badly when they get close to the Marks."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4017
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_4262c7e0:

    # sai "No todos. Fíjate en Jamaal. Y si siguen saliendo juntos, creo que Anthony no tendrá ningún problema en unirse a la familia."
    sai "Not all of them. Look at Jamaal. And if they keep dating, I reckon Anthony won't have any trouble joining the family."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4019
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_23b7692a:

    # mad "No lo conozco aún, pero, por lo que me habéis contado, parece un tipo majo."
    mad "I don't know him yet, but from what you've told me, he seems like a nice guy."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4021
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_c90472ea:

    # eva "Anthony es un... tío simpático. Y parece una persona interesante. Cuando lo investigué..."
    eva "Anthony is a... nice guy. And he seems like an interesting person. When I investigated him..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4023
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_ecc47743:

    # mad "¿Lo investigaste? ¿Por qué? ¿Había algo sospechoso en él? ¿O nos has investigado a todas?"
    mad "You investigated him? Why? Was there something suspicious about him? Or have you investigated all of us?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4025
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_4cec55aa:

    # eva "Bueno... investigué a su hermana, la médico de [mee]. Al investigarla a ella, empezaron a salir nombres y también los investigué. Anthony estaba entre ellos."
    eva "Well... I investigated his sister, [mee]'s doctor. When I investigated her, names started popping up, and I investigated them too. Anthony was among them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4026
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_8da717b2:

    # eva "Y sí. También os he investigado a vosotras. *Risa* Si te acercas a los Marks vas a ser investigado."
    eva "And yes. I've investigated you too. *Laugh* If you get close to the Marks, you're going to be investigated."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4028
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_1b3a87ac:

    # sai "¡Pero eso es injusto! ¡Somos de la familia!"
    sai "But that's unfair! We're family!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4030
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_3795371f:

    # eva "¿Tú sabías que ibas a ser de la familia cuando bajaste de aquel avión? Yo tampoco. Tenía que estar segura de que eras de fiar."
    eva "Did you know you were going to be family when you got off that plane? Me neither. I had to be sure you were trustworthy."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4031
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_79c66884:

    # eva "[ama] incluso investigó a Tía [bet] y a [mee] cuando llegaron."
    eva "[ama] even investigated Aunt [bet] and [mee] when they arrived."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4033
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_4650d23f:

    # mad "Entonces habéis investigado también a las chicas nuevas, ¿no? ¿Hay algo interesante que debamos saber?"
    mad "So you've investigated the new girls too, right? Is there anything interesting we should know?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4035
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_960a3b7f:

    # eva "Son chicas normales... O tan normales como sois vosotras."
    eva "They are normal girls... Or as normal as you are."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4037
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_07812592:

    # mad "*Risa* No sé si sentirme halagada o insultada."
    mad "*Laugh* I don't know whether to feel flattered or insulted."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4038
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_1a0a8a72:

    # mad "Pero aún no has dicho por qué te da mala espina [cri.nick]. ¿Es por algo que has descubierto cuando la investigabas?"
    mad "But you still haven't said why [cri.nick] gives you a bad feeling. Is it because of something you discovered when you investigated her?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4040
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_b92edc95:

    # eva "No, sólo es una corazonada. Lo que me dijo [eri] sobre ella me puso los pelos de la nuca de punta y he aprendido a hacerle caso a mi instinto."
    eva "No, it's just a hunch. What [eri] told me about her made the hairs on the back of my neck stand up, and I've learned to listen to my gut."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4041
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_76944698:

    # eva "Después me dijo que [mc] había dicho lo mismo. Quizás compartimos instinto."
    eva "Then she told me that [mc] had said the same thing. Maybe we share an instinct."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4043
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_e368f46c:

    # sai "Yo entiendo por qué [mc] reaccionó así. En Portland había una chica parecida. Pelo rosa, estudiaba Estudios de Género, y siempre estaba hablando del patriarcado."
    sai "I understand why [mc] reacted like that. There was a similar girl in Portland. Pink hair, studying Gender Studies, and always talking about the patriarchy."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4044
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_7bc90ff0:

    # sai "Era compañera de habitación de una amiga mía y, cuando se enteró de que [mc] y yo teníamos una relación abierta, estuvo machacándome durante días."
    sai "She was a roommate of a friend of mine, and when she found out that [mc] and I had an open relationship, she kept badgering me for days."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4045
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_ce99aaad:

    # sai "Decía que era una nueva herramienta que había inventado el patriarcado para dominar a las mujeres. Una estupidez, vaya."
    sai "She said it was a new tool invented by the patriarchy to dominate women. Utter nonsense, really."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4047
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_d319a66a:

    # mad "Nunca entenderé por qué la gente se mete en las relaciones de los demás."
    mad "I'll never understand why people interfere in other people's relationships."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4049
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_36304363:

    # mad "No quiero saber qué pensaría tu amiga de que [mc] tenga un harén. Seguramente le daría una apoplejía."
    mad "I don't want to know what your friend would think about [mc] having a harem. She'd probably have an aneurysm."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4051
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_0ce28727:

    # eva "Supongo que por eso desconfía de [cri.nick]."
    eva "I guess that's why he distrusts [cri.nick]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4053
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_da69c44d:

    # eva "Las relaciones de [mc] no son muy... normales."
    eva "[mc]'s relationships are not very... normal."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4055
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_6c11e659:

    # eva "Si [mc] está saliendo con su medio hermana..."
    eva "If [mc] is dating his half-sister..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4056
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_226f52b4:

    # eva "Y si alguien como tu amiga descubriera lo de los clones... No sé cómo reaccionaría."
    eva "And if someone like your friend found out about the clones... I don't know how she would react."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4058
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_d9430d37:

    # sai "No era mi amiga. Era la compañera de habitación de una amiga mía."
    sai "She wasn't my friend. She was the roommate of a friend of mine."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4059
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_ca6d7b8d:

    # sai "Pero precisamente por eso tanto [mc] como yo vamos a desconfiar de ella hasta que demuestre que no nos tenemos que preocupar."
    sai "But that is precisely why both [mc] and I are going to distrust her until she proves we have nothing to worry about."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4060
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_e7005593:

    # sai "[mc] es mejor persona que yo en eso y seguramente haya decidido darle el beneficio de la duda. Yo prefiero ser cauta."
    sai "[mc] is a better person than I am in that regard and has probably decided to give her the benefit of the doubt. I prefer to be cautious."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4062
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_49882395:

    # mad "Me parece lógico con vuestra experiencia con aquella chica de Portland."
    mad "That seems logical given your experience with that girl from Portland."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4063
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_aa64f4c2:

    # mad "¿Y tu prima? ¿Qué sabe de todo lo que está pasando en casa? ¿Qué le parece todo esto?"
    mad "What about your cousin? What does she know about everything that's happening at home? What does she think about all of it?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4065
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_55842ee6:

    # sai "Sabe algunas cosas, pero no todo."
    sai "She knows some things, but not everything."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4067
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_9d5e19fa:

    # sai "Sabe que estoy con [mc]."
    sai "She knows I am with [mc]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4069
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_cac4890a:

    # sai "Sabe que [mc] y yo no hemos vuelto juntos."
    sai "She knows [mc] and I haven't got back together."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4071
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_b44d00ab:

    # sai "Pero no le he contado nada del harén. Creo que será mejor explicárselo en persona."
    sai "But I haven't told her anything about the harem. I reckon it will be better to explain it in person when she's here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4072
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_fed278da:

    # sai "Y, obviamente, no sabe nada sobre NTR, clones, y guerras internas. No es que no me fíe de ella, pero es algo que no puedes explicar en una video conferencia."
    sai "And, obviously, she knows nothing about NTR, clones, and internal wars. It's not that I don't trust her, but it's something you can't explain in a video conference."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4074
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_d17495fc:

    # eva "¿Cómo crees que se va a tomar lo de los clones?"
    eva "How do you think she's going to take the clone thing?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4076
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_0e019523:

    # sai "Va a flipar. Siempre le ha gustado la ciencia ficción y lo que pasa en esta familia es lo más parecido que ha experimentado nunca."
    sai "She's going to flip out. She has always liked science fiction and what happens in this family is the closest thing she will ever experience."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4078
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_470dcda4:

    # sai "*Risa* Seguramente [ama] y tú no os la podáis quitar de encima durante meses."
    sai "*Laugh* I think [ama] and you won't be able to get rid of her for months."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4080
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_d1b83521:

    # sai "*Risa* Seguramente [eri], [dap] y [emm] no se la puedan quitar de encima durante meses."
    sai "*Laugh* I think [eri], [dap], and [emm] won't be able to get rid of her for months."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4081
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_ba09064e:

    # sai "Pero lo va a aceptar sin ningún problema."
    sai "But she will accept it without any fuss."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4083
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_d69e8951:

    # eva "Era una de las cosas que me preocupaban. No solo por ella, sino por todas las chicas nuevas."
    eva "That was one of the things I was worried about. Not just about her, but about all the new girls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4084
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_b42a435e:

    # eva "[ama] no va a estar en casa cuando lleguen y [dap], [eri] y yo podríamos pasar por trillizas..."
    eva "[ama] won't be home when they arrive, and [dap], [eri], and I could pass for triplets..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4085
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_1fe016b4:

    # eva "Pero no quiero empezar la relación con las chicas nuevas mintiéndoles. Somos quienes somos. No somos trillizas."
    eva "But I don't want to start the relationship with the new girls by lying to them. We are who we are. We are not triplets."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4087
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_84e0dab6:

    # mad "Joder, es complicado. No sé si yo sería capaz de decirle algo así a alguien que acaba de llegar a casa."
    mad "Damn, that's complicated. I don't know if I would be able to tell the whole story to someone who just arrived home."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4088
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_33260f8c:

    # mad "Al menos hasta no saber si podemos confiar en ellas. Es algo raro..."
    mad "At least not until we know if we can trust them. It's kind of weird..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4091
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_9294b1d4:

    # eva "*Risa* ¿Estás diciendo que soy rara? Te recuerdo que puedo sacarte uno de esos bonitos ojos con una cucharilla."
    eva "*Laugh* Are you saying I'm weird? I remind you that I can scoop out one of those pretty eyes with a spoon."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4093
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_eadb7a3f:

    # eva "*Risa* ¿Estás diciendo que [emm], [dap], y [eri] son raras? Te recuerdo que puedo sacarte uno de esos bonitos ojos con una cucharilla."
    eva "*Laugh* Are you saying [emm], [dap], and [eri] are weird? I remind you that I can scoop out one of those pretty eyes with a spoon."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4094
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_5e495934:

    # eva "*Risa* [sai] no es la única que puede amenazar con sacar ojos, ¿no?"
    eva "*Laugh* [sai] isn't the only one who can threaten to scoop out eyes, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4096
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_1f9c9bbb:

    # sai "*Risa* Sois unas idiotas. ¡Lo dije antes de conocer a [eil]! ¿Cuánto tiempo me lo vais a echar en cara?"
    sai "*Laugh* You are a bunch of idiots! I said that before I met [eil]! How long are you going to hold it against me?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4098
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_a9ad3ff3:

    # mad "*Risa* El resto de tu vida." (multiple=2)
    mad "*Laugh* For the rest of your life." (multiple=2)
# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4099
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_18d00923:

    # eva "*Risa* Para siempre." (multiple=2)
    eva "*Laugh* Forever." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4101
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_a301b267:

    # sai "*Risa* Si lo llego a saber, no os lo cuento. Capullas."
    sai "*Laugh* If I had known, I wouldn't have told you the story. Jerks."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4102
translate english c29s006_SaiEvaMad_8a53b98a:

    # sai "Pero deberíamos irnos ya. No tengo por qué aguantaros y ya debe ser casi nuestro turno."
    sai "But we should be off now. I don't have to put up with you lot, and it must be nearly our turn."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4110
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_b5539afe:

    # "Pasas el resto de la mañana en tu habitación. Por extraño que parezca, nadie viene a verte."
    "You spend the rest of the morning in your room. Strangely enough, no one comes to see you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4111
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_71be42f4:

    # "Cuando bajas a la cocina a por agua, incluso parece que no haya nadie en casa."
    "When you go down to the kitchen for a glass of water, it even seems like no one is home."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4112
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_33b6db9a:

    # "O incluso que, por alguna razón, te están evitando. Cuando vuelves a tu habitación, oyes susurros y risas ahogadas de las puertas."
    "Or even that, for some reason, they are avoiding you. When you return to your room, you hear whispers and muffled laughter behind closed doors."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4113
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_78c57257:

    # "Decides no llamar a ninguna de esas puertas. Aprovechas la tranquilidad para empezar a preparar maletas para el viaje a Aruba."
    "You decide not to knock on any of those doors. You take advantage of the quietness to start packing bags for the trip to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4114
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_69eca322:

    # "Ocupas parte del gimnasio para ir dejando las maletas que acabas. Por un momento, temes estar pareciéndote a [lis]."
    "You use part of the gym to leave the bags as you fill them up. For a moment, you fear you are starting to resemble [lis]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4116
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_f0ed3940:

    # "Cuando bajas a comer..."
    "When you go down for lunch..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4117
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_a51cb21d:

    # lis "*Risa* Eres demasiado imponente. Bueno, ya no, pero cuando te conocí me dabas un poco de miedo."
    lis "*Laugh* You are too imposing. Well, not anymore, but when I met you, you scared me a little."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4118
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_52462977:

    # oma "*Risa* Bueno, no nos conocimos en las mejores circunstancias. Estabas rodeada de imbéciles aquel día."
    oma "*Laugh* Well, we didn't meet under the best circumstances. You were surrounded by jerks that day."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4119
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_0a1ebdc0:

    # oma "Creo que, de todos los que había en la playa, Anthony y tú erais los únicos con un cerebro funcional."
    oma "I think, of everyone on the beach, Anthony and you were the only ones with a functional brain."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4120
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_d7d31889:

    # mc "¿Qué tal, chicas? ¿No bajáis a comer?"
    mc "How are you doing, girls? Aren't you coming down for lunch?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4122
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_af938346:

    # lis "Bajaremos en un par de minutos."
    lis "We'll be down in a couple of minutes."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4123
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_dd984cbb:

    # oma "Estamos esperando a que [kat] se acabe de cambiar. Hemos llegado hace unos minutos."
    oma "We're waiting for [kat] to finish changing. We just got back a few minutes ago."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4124
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_9ad99c5b:

    # mc "¿Dónde habéis ido? La casa estaba medio vacía."
    mc "Where did you go? The house was half empty."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4126
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_46f01b96:

    # lis "Hemos ido de compras..."
    lis "We went shopping..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4127
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_c2b1f1e8:

    # mc "*Risa* No sé por qué, pero estando tú involucrada, era lo que me imaginaba."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't know why, but with you involved, that's what I figured."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4129
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_e2e092ea:

    # oma "Bueno, todas teníamos algo que comprar, con lo que hemos aprovechado y hemos ido juntas."
    oma "Well, we all had something to buy, so we took advantage and went together."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4130
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_52491876:

    # oma "*Risa* Ocho chicas de compras juntas es una forma de crear vínculos."
    oma "*Laugh* Eight girls shopping together is a way to bond."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4131
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_9200e26d:

    # mc "¿Ocho? ¿Vosotras tres y quién más?"
    mc "Eight? You three and who else?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4133
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_969e550a:

    # lis "También han venido [sai], [mad.nick], [eva], [nor], y [eri]."
    lis "[sai], [mad.nick], [eva], [nor], and [eri] came too."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4134
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_bc622d2f:

    # lis "[mar] nos habló de una tienda nueva en San Luis Obispo y queríamos probarla."
    lis "[mar] told us about a new shop in San Luis Obispo, and we wanted to check it out."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4135
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_be063832:

    # mc "*Risa* Te tienes que 'Californiear' un poco más. Nadie le llama San Luis Obispo. Con San Luis hay suficiente."
    mc "*Laugh* You need to 'Californize' a little more. Nobody calls it San Luis Obispo. San Luis is enough."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4136
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_b5b37a99:

    # mc "Pero si iba [mad.nick] con vosotras..."
    mc "But if [mad.nick] went with you..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4138
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_8ef4cdab:

    # oma "*Risa* Ha podido ver qué vestidos tiene la competencia. Y se ha comprado uno precioso y super elegante."
    oma "*Laugh* She was able to see what dresses the competition has. And she bought a beautiful and super elegant one."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4139
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_b2f12239:

    # oma "Y va a quedar aún más bonito con las adaptaciones que le quiere hacer."
    oma "And it's going to look even prettier with the alterations she wants to make."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4140
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_b09f340b:

    # mc "[mad.nick] tiene mucho talento. Me extraña que no haya diseñado ella misma el vestido."
    mc "[mad.nick] is very talented when it comes to clothing design. I'm surprised she didn't design the dress herself."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4141
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_7a6932bb:

    # mc "Porque es para la gala en San Francisco, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Because it's for the gala in San Francisco, right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4143
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_831b3949:

    # lis "Supongo que lo usará para la gala... Sí..."
    lis "I suppose she'll use it for the gala... Yes..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4144
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_f640af73:

    # oma "Lo más probable... Es un vestido que no desentonaría en una gala..."
    oma "Most likely... It's a dress that wouldn't look out of place at a gala..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4145
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_b9e66bfe:

    # lis "Pero lo de diseñar ella misma el vestido..."
    lis "But designing the dress herself..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4146
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_1c7c5163:

    # oma "Podría ser una gran idea..."
    oma "That would be a great idea..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4147
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_34c7e2e2:

    # mc "Chicas, ¿pasa algo? ¿Me estáis ocultando algo?"
    mc "Girls, is something wrong? Are you hiding something from me?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4149
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_f61e7163:

    # oma "¿Qué? ¿Ocultarte algo?"
    oma "What? Hiding something from you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4150
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_025e50a1:

    # lis "¿A qué te refieres?"
    lis "What are you talking about?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4151
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_7c1c25dd:

    # mc "*Risa* Sabéis que me he criado con [emm], ¿verdad?"
    mc "*Laugh* You know I grew up with [emm], right?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4152
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_707aaf71:

    # mc "*Risa* Si existiera una 'cara de mentiroso', la Wiki tendría vuestras fotos para ilustrarla."
    mc "*Laugh* If a 'liar's face' existed, the Wiki would have your photos to illustrate it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4154
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_96eb1e12:

    # lis "¿Me estás llamando mentirosa?"
    lis "Are you calling me a liar?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4156
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_ef3660f4:

    # lis "¿No confías en tu princesa?"
    lis "Don't you trust your princess?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4157
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_9f21dec2:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso es algo que [emm] también haría."
    mc "*Laugh* That's something [emm] would say, too."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4159
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_4ac873be:

    # oma "Te puedo asegurar que no hemos dicho ninguna mentira."
    oma "I can assure you we haven't told any lies."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4160
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_61e135ab:

    # oma "Te recuerdo que en esta familia no mentimos. Y menos aún cuando hay cámaras cerca."
    oma "I remind you that in this family we don't lie. And even less so when there are cameras nearby."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4161
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_879b4cc8:

    # mc "*Risa* Okay, okay. No hace falta que me miréis como si fuerais a asesinarme."
    mc "*Laugh* Okay, okay. You don't have to look at me like you're going to murder me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4162
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_128ca4f3:

    # mc "De todas formas, creo que no os voy a sacar ninguna información sobre ese vestido..."
    mc "Anyway, I don't think I'm going to get any information about that dress out of you..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4164
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_9d8af188:

    # kat "Chicas, ya estoy lista. Ya podemos ir a comer."
    kat "Girls, I'm ready now. We can go eat."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4165
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_e9ed4afb:

    # mc "Hola, [kat]."
    mc "Hello, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4167
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_57ce3e62:

    # kat "¡[mc]!"
    kat "[mc]!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4170
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_5581175c:

    # "Con una velocidad sorprendente, [kat] se lanza a tus brazos a por un beso."
    "With surprising speed, [kat] launches herself into your arms for a kiss."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4171
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_e8d9a827:

    # "Si cada encuentro a partir de ahora va a ser así, no va a necesitar subir corriendo al lago muchas más veces."
    "If every encounter from now on is going to be like this, she won't need to run up to the lake many more times."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4172
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_3686e6d4:

    # "Va a hacer mucho ejercicio corriendo hasta tus labios."
    "She's going to get a lot of exercise running all the way to your lips."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4175
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_40b57981:

    # "Con una velocidad sorprendente, [kat] se lanza hacia ti a por un abrazo."
    "With surprising speed, [kat] lunges toward you for a hug."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4176
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_e8d9a827_1:

    # "Si cada encuentro a partir de ahora va a ser así, no va a necesitar subir corriendo al lago muchas más veces."
    "If every meeting from now on is going to be like this, she won't need to run up to the lake many more times."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4177
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_4883b2e6:

    # "Va a hacer mucho ejercicio corriendo hasta tus brazos."
    "She's going to get a lot of exercise running all the way to your arms."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4179
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_b42efbaf:

    # kat "Ya nos podemos ir. ¡Me muero de hambre!"
    kat "We can go now. I'm starving!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4181
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_407fe29a:

    # kat "[nor] me ha prometido que la lasaña de verdura que ha preparado hoy me va a gustar."
    kat "[nor] promised me that I would like the vegetable lasagna she prepared today."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4182
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_04550914:

    # mc "*Risa* Al final le pillarás el gusto a la verdura."
    mc "*Laugh* You'll eventually acquire a taste for vegetables."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4184
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_3a298398:

    # kat "*Risa* Pero siempre echaré de menos la pizza."
    kat "*Laugh* But I'll always miss pizza."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4185
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_9f93b893:

    # "Sabes que la salud de [kat] es lo más importante y que tiene por delante varios meses de dieta antes de resolver sus problemas."
    "You know that [kat]'s health is the most important thing, and that she has several months of dieting ahead of her before fixing her issues."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4186
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_112f3601:

    # "También sabes que, solo con el ejercicio que está haciendo, también lo resolvería."
    "You also know that, just with the exercise she is doing, she would fix them too. Slower, but she would fix them anyway."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4187
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_2f078a81:

    # mc "Solo hasta que consigas resolver tus problemas de azúcar. Después podrás comer pizza. Moderadamente."
    mc "Only until you manage to resolve your sugar problems. Then you will be able to eat pizza. Moderately."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4188
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_2a918452:

    # "También sabes que va a perder mucho peso en el proceso. Supones que, cuando vuelvas de Aruba, [kat] estará mucho más delgada."
    "You also know that she is going to lose a lot of weight in the process. You assume that, when you return from Aruba, [kat] will look a lot thinner."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4190
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_098bb0a0:

    # kat "Hoy estoy muy contenta de que no me convencieras para comer verduras. ¡[nor] ha hecho lasaña!"
    kat "Today, I'm very happy that you didn't convince me to eat vegetables. [nor] made lasagna!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4191
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_a4b82bac:

    # mc "*Risa* Estoy seguro de que te hubiera hecho una lasaña de verduras para ti."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm sure she would have made a vegetable lasagna just for you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4193
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_04c31227:

    # kat "*Risa* Es mejor para ti que no me veas en modo envidiosa y odiando a cada una de las chicas mientras ellas se comen una lasaña de verdad."
    kat "*Laugh* It's better for you not to see me in envious mode, hating every single girl while they eat real lasagna."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4194
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_5ca6e201:

    # mc "*Risa* Estoy de acuerdo contigo en eso. Yo siempre estaba de mal humor cuando empezaba una dieta."
    mc "*Laugh* I agree with you on that. I was always in a bad mood when I started a diet."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4195
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_3c04d9f6:

    # kat "*Risa* ¿No sabes que el tomate es una fruta y el trigo para hacer la harina es un vegetal? Una pizza con piña es casi una ensalada de frutas."
    kat "*Laugh* Don't you know that tomatoes are a fruit and the wheat used to make flour is a vegetable? A pizza with pineapple is practically a fruit salad."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4197
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_66846035:

    # oma "*Risa* Vámonos antes de que [kat] deje caer que le gusta la pizza con piña. Alguna de las chicas podría dejar de hablarle sólo por eso."
    oma "*Laugh* Let's go before [kat] lets slip that she likes pineapple on pizza. Some of the girls might stop talking to her just because of that."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4198
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_ba937345:

    # mc "¿A ninguna os gusta la pizza con piña?"
    mc "None of you like pineapple on pizza?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4200
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_268e826b:

    # lis "*Risa* No lo sabemos. Cuando alguien saca el tema, intentamos evitarlo. Hay gente muy militante en los dos bandos."
    lis "*Laugh* We don't know. When someone brings up the topic, we try to avoid it. There are very militant people on both sides."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4201
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_c113bea7:

    # mc "*Risa* Tienes razón. Mejor evitar el riesgo antes de crear una discusión."
    mc "*Laugh* You're right. Better avoid the risk before starting an argument."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4203
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_add9593e:

    # kat "*Risa* ¡He dicho que me muero de hambre y seguís hablando de comida cuando hay una lasaña esperándome en casa de [nor]!"
    kat "*Laugh* I said I'm starving and you're still talking about food when there's a lasagna waiting for me in [nor]'s kitchen!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4205
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_e84b3fb5:

    # mc "*Risa* Vamos a ver qué tal están esa lasaña de verduras. Conociendo a [nor], seguro que está buenísima."
    mc "*Laugh* Let's go see how that vegetable lasagna is. Knowing [nor], I'm sure it's delicious."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4207
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_393d4a6c:

    # mc "*Risa* Vamos a ver qué tal está esa lasaña. Conociendo a [nor], seguro que está buenísima."
    mc "*Laugh* Let's go see how that lasagna is. Knowing [nor], I'm sure it's delicious."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4210
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_05317e0b:

    # "[kat] te coge de la mano para bajar la escalera. Te sientes genial al ver que está tan ilusionada como tú por la nueva relación."
    "[kat] takes your hand to go down the stairs. You feel great seeing that she is as excited as you are about the new relationship."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4211
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_926f2701:

    # "Las otras dos chicas os miran tiernamente, alegrándose por ti y por su amiga."
    "The other two girls look at you tenderly, happy for you and their friend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4212
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_465d1a0d:

    # "[lis] no está dispuesta a reconocerlo todavía, pero hace tiempo que considera a [kat] una amiga."
    "[lis] isn't ready to admit it yet, but she has considered [kat] a friend for a while now."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4214
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_e6794750:

    # "No te equivocabas sobre lo sabrosa que está la lasaña."
    "You weren't wrong about how delicious the lasagna is."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4215
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_80baf2ea:

    # "Tampoco te equivocabas sobre que no podrías sacarles nada a las chicas sobre el vestido de [mad.nick]."
    "You also weren't wrong that you wouldn't be able to get anything out of the girls about [mad.nick]'s dress."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4216
translate english c29s007_OmaLis_8daf26d1:

    # "¿O es posible que, si no es para la gala, las ocho chicas hayan comprado vestidos para alguna ocasión especial que te estén ocultando?"
    "Or is it possible that, if it's not for the gala, the eight girls have bought dresses for some special occasion they are hiding from you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4224
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_87172f2d:

    # "Después de comer las chicas parecen seguir evitándote por alguna razón."
    "After lunch, the girls still seem to be avoiding you for some reason."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4225
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_57b3d8b2:

    # "Empiezas a echar de menos que alguien venga a pedir tu ayuda con un enchufe o que te pida que la lleves a algún sitio."
    "You start to miss someone coming to ask for your help with a socket or asking you to drive them somewhere."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4226
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_35a862dc:

    # "La única interrupción es cuando [ama] viene a decirte que, si la necesitas, estará con [mar] y [nor] en la cocina de [nor], aprendiendo a cocinar."
    "The only interruption is when [ama] comes to tell you that, if you need her, she will be with [mar] and [nor] in [nor]'s kitchen, learning how to cook."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4227
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_d6e35ac1:

    # "Te sientes solo por primera vez desde que volviste a casa."
    "You feel lonely for the first time since you returned home."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4228
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_2a170715:

    # "Decides bajar a la piscina. Seguro que, tarde o temprano, aparece alguien."
    "You decide to go down to the pool. Surely, sooner or later, someone will show up."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4230
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_7a0fbc55:

    # "Para tu sorpresa, [dap], [sca], y [deb.nick] están en la piscina y no hacen ningún gesto que indique que quieran evitarte."
    "To your surprise, [dap], [sca], and [deb.nick] are in the pool and don't make any gesture indicating they want to avoid you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4231
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_16935847:

    # "[sca] incluso te hace señas para que te acerques."
    "[sca] even signals for you to come closer."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4232
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e8521b6b:

    # "¿Estás volviéndote paranoico y malinterpretando la situación?"
    "Are you becoming paranoid and misinterpreting the situation?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4234
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_0f7a7eed:

    # mc "Hola, chicas. ¿Qué tal?"
    mc "Hi, girls. How are you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4235
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_474e10be:

    # todas "Bien, ¿y tú?"
    todas "Good, and you?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4237
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_eb7d632a:

    # sca "Estábamos intentando convencer a [deb.nick] para que se una a la partida de DnD."
    sca "We were trying to convince [deb.nick] to join the DnD game."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4238
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_cba79427:

    # mc "¿Jugaremos mañana? No me habéis dicho nada..."
    mc "Are we playing tomorrow? You hadn't said anything..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4240
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_a444c4be:

    # dap "No, no jugaremos mañana. He estado ocupada estos días y no tengo preparada la próxima sesión."
    dap "No, we won't be playing tomorrow. I've been busy these days and haven't prepared the next session yet."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4241
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b4691538:

    # dap "Incluiros a [mad.nick] y a ti ha creado ramificaciones que aún no tengo claras a dónde pueden llevar."
    dap "Including [mad.nick] and you has created some branching, and I'm still not sure where they might lead. I'm still getting the next session ready."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4242
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_5fa58c45:

    # mc "La próxima partida en la que pueda estar será al volver de Aruba, entonces."
    mc "The next game I can be in will be after returning from Aruba, then."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4244
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_5b3d0545:

    # sca "Depende... [dap] y yo hemos hablado de jugar contigo por videoconferencia. Supongo que tendrás libre algún domingo por la noche."
    sca "It depends... [dap] and I have talked about playing with you via video conference. I assume you'll have some Sunday nights free."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4245
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_8c182edc:

    # mc "¿Se puede hacer eso? ¿Cómo sabréis lo que saco en los dados?"
    mc "Can we do that? How will you know what I roll on the dice?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4247
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_035235ab:

    # deb "Porque todas sabemos que no mentirás si sacas una mala tirada."
    deb "Because we all know you won't lie if you get a bad roll."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4248
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_d03b713c:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿De qué serviría? Hacer trampas en un juego mata la diversión."
    mc "*Laugh* What would be the point? Cheating in a game kills the fun."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4249
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_77072e9c:

    # mc "¿Y te apetece unirte?"
    mc "And do you feel like joining?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4251
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_189ecb2b:

    # deb "Siempre he querido probarlo, y [dap] es una gran contadora de historias, con lo que creo que estaría bien."
    deb "I've always wanted to try it, and [dap] is a great storyteller, so I think it would be good to give it a try."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4252
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e3d66eb3:

    # deb "Además, sería otra forma de hacer más cosas con las chicas. Si no me gusta, [dap] podría matar a mi personaje para sacarlo de la historia."
    deb "Plus, it would be another way to do more things with the girls. If I don't like it, [dap] could kill off my character to get me out of the story."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4253
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_48512f16:

    # mc "Parece que ya te han convencido."
    mc "It looks like they've already convinced you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4255
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_81fbfcc4:

    # sca "*Risa* Podemos ser muy insistentes. ¿Qué te parece la idea?"
    sca "*Laugh* We can be very persistent. What do you think of the idea?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4256
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e14c688b:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea de cuánto tiempo libre tendré, y hay que tener en cuenta la diferencia horaria, pero me parece buena idea si se pudiera hacer."
    mc "I have no idea how much free time I'll have, and we have to consider the time zones, but it sounds like a good idea if we can make it work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4257
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_fcd6b05c:

    # mc "Sería una forma de pasar tiempo con vosotras mientras estoy fuera."
    mc "It would be a way to spend time with you all while I'm away."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4259
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_f53e7d7a:

    # dap "Espero que nos llames para más cosas que para jugar. Va a ser una partida cada dos o tres semanas, más o menos. Y te vamos a echar de menos todos los días."
    dap "I hope you call us for more than just playing games. It's going to be one session every two or three weeks, more or less. And we're going to miss you every day."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4260
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_259742e3:

    # mc "Yo también, pero no sé si tendré tiempo para hacer 22 videoconferencias diarias."
    mc "Me too, but I don't know if I'll have time for 22 daily video calls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4262
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_c51b3123:

    # deb "*Risa* Sólo serán 20. [ama] y Tía [bet] estarán allí contigo. ¿Quieres decir que no vas a poder sacar tiempo para hacer 20 llamadas al día?"
    deb "*Laugh* It will only be 20. [ama] and Aunt [bet] will be there with you. Are you saying you won't be able to make time for 20 calls a day?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4263
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_4176fd64:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Os contentaréis con llamadas de 10 minutos cada una?"
    mc "*Laugh* Will you all settle for 10-minute calls each?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4265
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_08e7aa2c:

    # todas "*Risa* ¡No!"
    todas "*Laugh* No!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4266
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_735896db:

    # mc "*Risa* Entonces creo que haremos algunas llamadas grupales."
    mc "*Laugh* Then I guess we'll do some group calls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4268
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_f63dde01:

    # sca "Hablando en serio, creo que no es necesario que llames a todas las chicas todos los días."
    sca "Seriously though, I don't think you need to call all the girls every day."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4269
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e29fa96a:

    # sca "*Risa* Me puedes llamar a mí y yo les paso tus mensajes."
    sca "*Laugh* You can call me everyday, and I'll pass on your messages."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4270
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_a4aca538:

    # mc "*Risa* Cuando has empezado con 'Hablando en serio', creía que ibas a aportar una solución que no incluyera tu asesinato."
    mc "*Laugh* When you started with 'Seriously though,' I thought you were going to suggest something that didn't involve your assassination."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4271
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_d79cbd7b:

    # mc "Si me paso una semana sin hablar con cualquiera de vosotras y todos los días hablo contigo..."
    mc "If I go a week without talking to any of you and talk to you every day..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4273
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_fd687a24:

    # dap "*Risa* Recordad que hay cámaras en la piscina. [eva] tiene que estar empezando a afilar cuchillos si está escuchando esto."
    dap "*Laugh* Remember there are cameras by the pool. [eva] must be starting to sharpen knives if she's listening to this."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4274
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_2e7a4640:

    # mc "*Risa* [eva], sé que me estás escuchando, no te preocupes. Te prometo que no me pasaré una semana sin hablar contigo."
    mc "*Laugh* [eva], I know you're listening, don't worry. I promise I won't go a week without talking to you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4276
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_0437f369:

    # deb "*Risa* Creo que eso la calmará un poco. Además, ella pasará un mes contigo allí cuando vuelva [ama]."
    deb "*Laugh* I think that will calm her down a bit. Plus, she'll spend a month with you there when [ama] returns."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4277
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_0060ffe6:

    # mc "Estaremos trabajando. No creo que eso pueda contar como pasar tiempo juntos."
    mc "We'll be working. I don't think that counts as spending time together."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4278
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_16d509e5:

    # mc "Aunque supongo que tendremos tiempo para hacer cosas juntos después del trabajo."
    mc "Although I guess we'll have time to do things together after work."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4280
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_a878a777:

    # sca "Sería raro que estuvieras empleando tu tiempo en hacer videoconferencias con Jamaal y con las chicas que nos quedamos y descuidaras a las que están allí contigo."
    sca "It would be weird if you were spending your time video calling Jamaal and the girls who stayed behind, and neglecting the ones who are there with you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4282
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e9771047:

    # mc "Sería rarísimo e injusto. Ayer hice una videoconferencia con Meemaw y Tía [bet] cuando estaba acabando el picnic con [kim]."
    mc "That would be extremely weird and unfair. Yesterday, I had a video call with Meemaw and Aunt [bet] when I was finishing the picnic with [kim]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4283
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b838de68:

    # mc "Me sentí como si la videoconferencia le estuviera quitando a [kim] tiempo a solas conmigo. Sé que no es así, pero..."
    mc "I felt like the video call was taking away [kim]'s alone time with me. I know it's not like that, but..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4285
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_8a39efe1:

    # mc "Sería rarísimo e injusto. Sería como decir que prefiero a las chicas que os habéis quedado en casa."
    mc "That would be extremely weird and unfair. It would be like saying I prefer the girls who stayed home."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4286
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e306d27b:

    # mc "¿Pero sabéis qué es lo raro de verdad?"
    mc "But do you know what's really weird?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4288
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_c254b1fc:

    # todas "¿Qué?"
    todas "What?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4289
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_f2f68d50:

    # mc "Que vosotras dos estéis dentro de la piscina mientras nuestra sirena residente está fuera. ¿Nuestra sirenita desperdiciando la oportunidad de bañarse? Rarísimo."
    mc "That you two are in the pool while our resident mermaid is not. Our little mermaid wasting the chance to swim? Super weird."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4291
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_859ff5e6:

    # deb "Bueno... No puedo bañarme hoy..."
    deb "Well... I can't swim today..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4293
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_6276448b:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Te encuentras bien?"
    mc "Why? Are you feeling okay?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4294
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b94861bb:

    # deb "Tengo una pequeño sangrado, y no puedo bañarme hasta que empiece a cicatrizar. No es nada serio, pero no quiero que se infecte y sea peor."
    deb "I have a small bleeding, and I can't swim until it starts to heal. It's nothing serious, but I don't want it to get infected and get worse."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4295
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_1b74eb3e:

    # mcp "(¡Mierda! ¿Le hice daño cuando estuvimos juntos?)"
    mcp "(Shit! Did I hurt her when we were together?)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4297
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_19c7e986:

    # mcp "(¡Mierda! ¡Parezco idiota! Esta chica seguirá teniendo la regla... ¡Parece mentira que me haya criado entre mujeres!)"
    mcp "(Shit! I look like an idiot! This girl still gets her period... It's unbelievable that I was raised among women!)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4298
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_c6b7a0a4:

    # mc "En ese caso, no es tan raro... ¿Qué te pasa?"
    mc "In that case, it's not so weird... What's wrong?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4300
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_c99887c9:

    # sca "¡[mc]! ¡Eso no se le pregunta a una chica cuando no puede bañarse!"
    sca "[mc]! You don't ask a girl that when she can't swim!"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4301
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_564fe2d4:

    # mcp "(OK. Duda resuelta.)"
    mcp "(OK. Mystery solved.)"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4303
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_696fef9b:

    # dap "¿Y tú? ¿Vas a meterte en la piscina con nosotras?"
    dap "What about you? Are you going to get in the pool with us?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4304
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_78ffffc2:

    # mc "Creo que no. Me quedaré sentado en el borde con [deb.nick]. Al menos podrá mojarse los pies."
    mc "I don't think so. I'll stay sitting on the edge with [deb.nick]. At least she can put her feet in the pool."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4305
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_992f5675:

    # dap "Siempre intentando ser el caballero de la brillante armadura."
    dap "Always trying to be the knight in shining armor."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4306
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e28bbf3a:

    # mc "Lo hago sin intentarlo... Me sale de dentro."
    mc "I do it without trying... It just comes naturally."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4308
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_92d7ee02:

    # deb "Chicas, id a nadar un rato. Os estabais quedando aquí para no dejarme sola, pero ahora tengo a [mc] para hacerme compañía."
    deb "Girls, go swim for a while. You were staying here so I wouldn't be alone, but now I have [mc] to keep me company."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4309
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_6e0475e3:

    # sca "¿No te importa? A nosotras no nos molesta quedarnos contigo toda la tarde."
    sca "You don't mind? We don't mind staying with you all afternoon."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4310
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_61e4685e:

    # deb "No me importa, de verdad. Me estaba empezando a sentir culpable."
    deb "I don't mind, really. I was starting to feel guilty."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4311
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_59da3bba:

    # dap "Entonces os dejamos un rato. Vamos a hacer unos largos y un par de carreras."
    dap "Then we'll leave you for a bit. We're going to do some laps and a couple of races."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4312
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_8df1134b:

    # mc "Pasáoslo bien. Estaremos aquí mismo."
    mc "Have fun. We'll be right here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4315
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_4a073b29:

    # mc "¿Ya has acabado de leer Villette?"
    mc "Have you finished reading Villette yet?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4316
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_a2b2d8e8:

    # deb "Aún no. Me gusta, pero es un poco denso y no es un libro para leer demasiadas horas seguidas."
    deb "Not yet. I like it, but it's a bit dense, and it's not a book you can read for too many hours straight."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4317
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_a2bec68a:

    # deb "Me sorprende que recuerdes el título."
    deb "I'm surprised you remember the title."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4318
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_acf6bffb:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso es una demostración de que estaba prestando atención, ¿no?"
    mc "*Laugh* That's proof I was paying attention, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4321
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b9b48fd9:

    # deb "*Risa* Tienes razón, pero no esperaba menos de mi novio."
    deb "*Laugh* You're right, but I wouldn't expect anything less from my boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4323
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_25df6f24:

    # deb "*Risa* Tienes razón, pero no esperaba menos de un buen amigo."
    deb "*Laugh* You're right, but I expected nothing less from a good friend."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4324
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_ae797418:

    # mc "*Siempre presto atención a lo que dices."
    mc "I always pay attention to what you say."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4326
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_47f60c4:

    # deb "Son increíbles, ¿verdad?"
    deb "They are incredible, aren't they?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4328
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_fa4aa0a7:

    # mc "¿[dap] y [sca]? Sí, pero no sé a qué te refieres."
    mc "[dap] and [sca]? Yes, but I don't know what you mean."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4330
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_7d189cc0:

    # deb "Iban a renunciar a su tarde en la piscina por no dejarme sola. Estaba a punto de irme a mi habitación cuando has llegado."
    deb "They were going to give up their afternoon at the pool so they wouldn't leave me alone. I was about to go to my room when you arrived."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4331
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_df1570a4:

    # deb "No quería que tuvieran que dejar de nadar por mí."
    deb "I didn't want them to have to stop swimming because of me."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4332
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_37e93551:

    # mc "No estaban renunciando a nada, [deb.nick]. Estaban pasando tiempo contigo. Estoy seguro de que preferían eso a estar nadando y jugando en el agua."
    mc "They weren't giving up anything, [deb.nick]. They were spending time with you. I'm sure they preferred that over swimming and playing in the water."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4334
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_558e5468:

    # deb "Nunca he tenido amigas así. Es raro, pero increíblemente bonito. [lis] piensa lo mismo."
    deb "I've never had friends like this. It's strange, but incredibly beautiful. [lis] thinks the same."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4337
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_9f2aa3a4:

    # deb "Gracias por la noche con [lis], por cierto."
    deb "Thanks for the night with [lis], by the way."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4338
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_222bed18:

    # mc "¿Gracias? No te entiendo..."
    mc "Thanks? I don't understand..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4339
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_e2c600bf:

    # deb "Me explicó que no se había portado bien durante la fiesta..."
    deb "She explained that she hadn't behaved well during the party..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4340
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_c1ac9abe:

    # mc "Bueno, sus amigas estaban allí y hacía tiempo que no las veía."
    mc "Well, her friends were there and she hadn't seen them in a while."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4342
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_044ce773:

    # deb "No me ha dado detalles, pero me dijo algo sobre descubrir dónde estaba la amistad de verdad."
    deb "She didn't give me details, but she told me something about discovering where true friendship lies."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4344
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_c48bd1d7:

    # deb "Es genial que, aparte de su novio, te considere su amigo. La entiendo."
    deb "It's great that, besides her boyfriend, she considers you her friend. I understand how she feels."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4346
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_2b0bdd37:

    # deb "No por lo de novio, claro..."
    deb "Not because of the boyfriend thing, of course..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4347
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_aa64edaa:

    # mc "No se refería a mí, [deb]. Sino a todas las chicas."
    mc "She wasn't referring to me, [deb]. But to all the girls."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4349
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_5f94c372:

    # deb "Entonces la entiendo mejor aún. Creo que no se podrían tener mejores amigas que las que hemos encontrado en esta familia."
    deb "Then I understand her even better. I don't think we could have better friends than the ones we've found in this family."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4352
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_73d7fa70:

    # deb "Ayer, cuando volvió de la fiesta en LA, me dijo algo sobre descubrir dónde estaba la amistad de verdad."
    deb "Yesterday, when she returned from the party in LA, she told me something about discovering where true friendship lies."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4354
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_11dbc7be:

    # mc "Me encanta que os sintáis así. Creo que todo el mundo siente algo parecido."
    mc "I love that you all feel that way. I think everyone feels something similar."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4356
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_2786f5d3:

    # deb "Nunca os he dado las gracias por confiar en nosotras con el tema de [ama] y [eva]..."
    deb "I never thanked you for trusting us with the [ama] and [eva] situation..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4357
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_8fc557d3:

    # mc "Y no hace falta darlas. Era una situación... diferente... y teníamos que confiar en vosotras o esconderlas a ellas."
    mc "And you don't need to. It was a... different... situation, and we had to trust you or hide them."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4358
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_0cc79a2d:

    # mc "Creo que hicimos bien en confiar en vosotras."
    mc "I think we did well to trust you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4360
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_dad986bd:

    # deb "Yo también pienso lo mismo. Creo que la fiesta de Navidad de [sca] en la playa hizo mucho para que nos sintiéramos integradas."
    deb "I feel the same way. I believe [sca]'s Christmas party on the beach did a lot to make us feel integrated."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4361
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_19eb3475:

    # deb "Pero que mostrarais esa confianza en nosotras fue el paso definitivo."
    deb "But showing that trust in us was the definitive step."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4362
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_bb9f9c0f:

    # deb "No lo hubiéramos sabido si no lo hubierais hecho, al menos inmediatamente, pero que mostrarais esa confianza en nosotras hizo que..."
    deb "We wouldn't have known if you hadn't done it, at least immediately, but showing that trust in us made it so that..."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4363
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_6a2426c6:

    # deb "Que sintiéramos que formábamos parte de algo más grande."
    deb "That we felt we were part of something bigger."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4364
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_04aafeeb:

    # mc "*Risa* Había una tercera opción, pero seguramente [eva] tendría que matarte si te la cuento."
    mc "*Laugh* There was a third option, but [eva] would probably have to kill you if I told you about it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4366
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_78fbd58a:

    # deb "*Risa* ¡Muy gracioso! ¿Cuál era la tercera opción?"
    deb "*Laugh* Very funny! What was the third option?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4367
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_7eaa01df:

    # mc "Podríamos haberos mentido, o podríamos haber cerrado el dormitorio, o hacer la presentación de [eva] y [ama] en otro sitio."
    mc "We could have lied to you, or we could have closed the dorm, or held [eva] and [ama]'s presentation somewhere else."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4368
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_35ab5677:

    # mc "Había muchas opciones, pero la única buena era confiar en vosotras."
    mc "There were many options, but the only good one was trusting you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4370
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_9d58e59c:

    # deb "Me alegra que lo hicierais. Y me alegra poder considerar amigas a [ama] y a [eva]."
    deb "I'm glad you did. And I'm glad I can consider [ama] and [eva] as friends."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4371
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_abe55b39:

    # mc "Os necesitan. Nos necesitan a todos. Necesitaban una familia, y ahora la tienen."
    mc "They need you. They need all of us. They needed a family, and now they have one."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4373
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_35cffd47:

    # deb "Pero es un camino de dos direcciones. Nosotras también las necesitamos a ellas. Y las queremos. No me puedo imaginar mi vida sin las dos en ella."
    deb "But it's a two-way street. We need them too. And we love them. I can't imagine my life without the two of them in it."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4374
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_628747d3:

    # deb "O sin [dap] y [sca]. O sin ti... Creo que no podría renunciar a nadie de las personas que he conocido aquí."
    deb "Or without [dap] and [sca]. Or without you... I don't think I could give up on anyone I've met here."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4375
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b6c60d80:

    # mc "¿Se lo has dicho alguna vez?"
    mc "Have you ever told them?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4377
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_2c6f2258:

    # deb "No. Me sentiría ridícula si lo hiciera. No vas por ahí diciéndole eso a una amiga sin venir a cuento."
    deb "No. I would feel ridiculous if I did. You don't just go around telling a friend that out of the blue."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4378
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_52e1c20d:

    # mc "A mí me lo acabas de decir, y creo que deberías decírselo a [ama]. [eva] ya te ha escuchado."
    mc "You just told me, and I think you should tell [ama]. [eva] has already heard you."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4380
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_ca0ef3ec:

    # deb "¡Oh, mierda! [eva]... lo digo en serio... Os quiero a las dos. Siento no habértelo dicho antes."
    deb "Oh, shit! [eva]... I mean it... I love you both. I'm sorry I didn't tell you sooner."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4381
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_d7ae88cf:

    # mc "Ahora solo falta que se lo digas a [ama]. No sería justo para ella que lo viera en una grabación en diferido."
    mc "Now you just need to tell [ama]. It wouldn't be fair for her to see it in a video recording."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4383
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b68b07d6:

    # deb "¿Sabes dónde está?"
    deb "Do you know where she is?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4384
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_56052581:

    # mc "[nor] y [mar] iban a enseñarle nociones básicas de cocina."
    mc "[nor] and [mar] were going to teach her basic cooking skills."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4387
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_bec47ac8:

    # deb "Entonces voy para allá. Una vez se lo he dicho a [eva]... Me siento menos ridícula... ¿Vienes conmigo?"
    deb "Then I'm heading over there. Now that I've told [eva]... I feel less ridiculous... Are you coming with me?"

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4388
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_38d0e1e5:

    # mc "Creo que debe ser una conversación entre vosotras. Y [mar] y [nor], obviamente."
    mc "I think it should be a conversation between you two. And [mar] and [nor] will be there, obviously."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4389
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_06e4f4bb:

    # deb "Gracias, [mc]."
    deb "Thank you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4391
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_f21d414f:

    # "Tras despediros de [dap] y [sca], [deb.nick] se dirige a la cocina de [nor]."
    "After saying goodbye to [dap] and [sca], [deb.nick] heads to [nor]'s kitchen."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4392
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_13f7c403:

    # "Decides ir a darte una ducha y tú también te despides de las dos chicas que hay en el agua."
    "You decide to go take a shower and you also say goodbye to the two girls in the water."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4394
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_f7da673e:

    # "Después de intentar secarse infructuosamente las lágrimas que corren por sus mejillas, [eva] hace una copia del video de lo que acaba de pasar en la piscina."
    "After unsuccessfully trying to wipe away the tears streaming down her cheeks, [eva] makes a copy of the video of what just happened in the pool."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4395
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_0834d6fb:

    # "Algún día descubrirás que el servidor privado de [eva] está lleno de recuerdos tiernos."
    "Someday you will discover that [eva]'s private server is full of tender memories."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4397
translate english c29s007_DapDebSca_b313c644:

    # "El servidor de [ama] también tiene muchos recuerdos, y tendrá uno más en cuanto vuelva a la base y pueda hacer una copia."
    "The server belonging to [ama] also has many memories, and it will have one more as soon as she returns to base and can make a copy of the video of what happened in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c29/c29.rpy:4398
